			{3698918, "pick", "vo_901_bolvar_32_m", "What news?"},
			{4324152, "pick", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_27", "We will finish this"},
			{3771142, "aggro", "mon_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_aggro_169020", "Vrooooooooom"},
			{3771180, "shout", "mon_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_battleshout_01_169021", "YEAH!"},
			{3771178, "shout", "mon_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_battleshout_02_169021", "AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH"},
			{3771176, "shout", "mon_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_battleshout_03_169021", "HAAAAAA"},
			{3771174, "shout", "mon_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_battleshout_04_169021", "RAAAAAAHHH!!!"},
			{3771196, "alert", "mon_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_alert_01_169019", "Heh."},
			{3771194, "alert", "mon_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_alert_02_169019", "Whoosh"},
			{3771192, "alert", "mon_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_alert_03_169019", "Hah!"},
			{2408318, "line", "vo_81_the_lich_king_-_bolvar_01_m", "The Banshee Queen schemes threaten the balance. I had no hand in them."},
			{2408319, "line", "vo_81_the_lich_king_-_bolvar_02_m", "Vol'jin, your soul has walked on the other side and returned. You have been altered more than you know."},
			{2408320, "line", "vo_81_the_lich_king_-_bolvar_03_m", "You are neither undead nor damned. You do not belong here. Leave this place at once."},
			{2408321, "line", "vo_81_the_lich_king_-_bolvar_04_m", "Leave now, or stay forever. The choice is yours."},
			{3256072, "line", "vo_835_the_lich_king_-_bolvar_01_m", "Go now, and do what must be done."},
			{3256073, "line", "vo_835_the_lich_king_-_bolvar_02_m", "Do not be merciful."},
			{3256074, "line", "vo_835_the_lich_king_-_bolvar_03_m", "You are prepared for the war to come."},
			{3256075, "line", "vo_835_the_lich_king_-_bolvar_04_m", "destiny calls to you"},
			{3256076, "line", "vo_835_the_lich_king_-_bolvar_05_m", "There is much to be done."},
			{3256077, "line", "vo_835_the_lich_king_-_bolvar_06_m", "You are empty inside, just like me."},
			{3149390, "line", "vo_83_the_lich_king_-_bolvar_01_m"},
			{3149391, "line", "vo_83_the_lich_king_-_bolvar_02_m"},
			{3149392, "line", "vo_83_the_lich_king_-_bolvar_03_m"},
			{3605021, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_01_m", "Be at ease. I am Bolvar Fordragon. These knights and I are here to help."},
			{3620380, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_02_m", "This is most dire news, we must not let war ravage this plane and unravel all that we have done."},
			{3638213, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_03_m", "It seems the Jailer has been pulling the strings of fate on our world as well."},
			{3669889, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_04_m", "Enough! The war is over! We can ill afford to start another!"},
			{3669890, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_05_m", "A far more pressing threat is at hand, and we must prepare to face it."},
			{3669922, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_06_m", "When the Banshee shattered the helm, it tore a gaming wound through the veil between our world and the Shadowlands."},
			{3669923, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_07_m", "During my vigil, upon the frozen throne, I caught fleeting glimpses into the realms of death. Among them, I saw a place of inescapable darkness."},
			{3669924, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_08_m", "That is where you must go, if you are to save those Sylvanas has taken. Together, we can open the way."},
			{3669925, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_09_m", "Place the shards of domination around the circle of runes then the ritual can begin"},
			{3669926, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_10_m", "When the helm rested upon my head it took all my will to keep its insidious power in check Many times I nearly faltered"},
			{3669937, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_11_m", "I could sense a dark presence at the edge of my consciousness, not Arthas, not Ner'zhul, something else."},
			{3669942, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_12_m", "It is that very presence I sense lurking beyond the shattered sky above."},
			{3669943, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_13_m", "I dare not travel with you, even free of the helm. I fear I would become bound to the will of its true master."},
			{3669944, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_14_m", "But this threat cannot be left unchecked therefore you must venture where I cannot"},
			{3669945, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_15_m", "The dangers you face will be considerable alone you may well be outmatched"},
			{3669946, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_16_m", "To aid in this task, the Knights of the Ebon Blade shall lend you their strength. Darian Mograine has volunteered to fight at your side."},
			{3669948, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_17_m", "Living mortals were never intended to cross beyond the veil. Where you are going, you may be unable to return."},
			{3669949, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_18_m", "But there is no other course. Death comes to claim Azeroth. It falls to you to defend her."},
			{3669950, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_19_m", "The time has come, take up the Shattered Helm and we will open the rift."},
			{3669951, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_20_m", "The path opens."},
			{3677827, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_21_m", "As you wish. Champion, please confirm where our acolytes should open the portals."},
			{3677828, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_22_m", "Of course, there is much to tell. We will talk later, champion."},
			{3677829, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_23_m", "And when she sundered the helm, the sky above the Citadel shattered. The spire of an immense tower appeared beyond the veil."},
			{3677830, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_24_m", "Sylvanas Windrunner sent her agents to abduct them, dark winged beings who caught them in chains and dragged them through the shattered sky."},
			{3698911, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_25_m", "The balance must be restored."},
			{3698913, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_27_m", "Much has been asked. More will be required."},
			{3698914, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_28_m", "We all have our burdens to bear."},
			{3698915, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_29_m", "I fear darker days are to come."},
			{3698916, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_30_m", "The chains of the past still bind us."},
			{3706269, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_37_m", "You do not understand the risk, Talia. For me to peer into the Maw would... ...would mean."},
			{3706273, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_38_m", "My shining star, I will do as you request."},
			{3717929, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_39_m", "Shandris, this may be your only hope of saving Tyrande."},
			{3717930, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_40_m", "Shandris, I know what it is to bear the scars of war. But this maw walker may be your only hope of saving Tyrande."},
			{3717935, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_41_m", "It would seem you must brave the horrors of them all once again."},
			{3717936, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_42_m", "I know not how to locate this missing Maldraxxi Baron, nor our living allies. But I believe I can help you find Darian Mograine. That's a start, at least."},
			{3717937, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_43_m", "Honored Voice, we seek entrance to the Maw."},
			{3717938, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_44_m", "We know the risk. There is no choice but to try."},
			{3717939, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_45_m", "Go carefully champion find Darian and he will age your hunt for the missing Baron"},
			{3717950, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_46_m", "Come at once to Oribos, Maw Walker. I feel a darkness calling to me."},
			{3717951, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_47_m", "I fear something rises within Torghast. Something... terrible."},
			{3717952, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_48_m", "Aye, malevolence, crowing, domination, rising!"},
			{3717953, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_49_m", "No, not again."},
			{3717954, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_50_m", "A weapon forged in the fires of Torghast, a morn blade is born."},
			{3717955, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_51_m", "There is a price to be paid, for communing with that darkness again, but I must see. We all must know."},
			{3717956, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_52_m", "Aid me, champion."},
			{3717957, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_53_m", "The Link has been severed. That is all I can... wait. Something is..."},
			{3717958, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_54_m", "I will not serve you!!"},
			{3717959, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_55_m", "Aaaaaawwwwww!!!"},
			{3717960, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_56_m", "My thanks to all of you, but Jaina is right. The Jailer knows what we saw. He will use that knowledge against us."},
			{3717961, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_57_m", "Maw Walker, continue your efforts. Explore the dark reaches of Torghast. Fight for the Shadowlands. And when the time comes, we will claim victory!"},
			{3718353, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_58_m", "No, Bane. Though your heart yearns to help save your friends, your body needs to recover."},
			{3718354, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_59_m", "The attendants here can tend your wounds while the maw walker seeks our allies Stay and tell me what you learned from your time inside the maw"},
			{3718377, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_60_m", "The darkness is all-consuming. I can see only the merest shapes in this lightless void."},
			{3718378, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_61_m", "Given the chance, the beasts of these halls will hunt down and consume wandering souls. Yours included."},
			{3718379, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_62_m", "It is difficult to focus here. Its very nature seems ever shifting, wreaking havoc upon my perceptions."},
			{3718380, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_63_m", "How these Maldraxxi prisoners were taken we cannot know, but they must be freed from their torment."},
			{3718381, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_64_m", "This is the place I saw when I peered into Torghast. Lady Proudmoore is near."},
			{3718382, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_65_m", "The souls here are forced to burn smelted into raw material for the jailers vile creations"},
			{3718395, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_66_m", "That is all I can see. It is too dangerous to push further."},
			{3718398, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_67_m", "Not yet, Calia. There is a price to be paid for such visions. I dare not attempt another so soon."},
			{3718400, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_68_m", "Please aid them honored voice while I talk with the others We must consider the implications of what we've seen"},
			{3724206, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_69_m", "The Broken Helm still resonates with the power of the Lich King, the power of the Maw."},
			{3724207, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_70_m", "Together, we can focus our sight deep into the Jailer's realm. But beware, do not lose yourself within the darkness."},
			{3738338, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_71_m", "And that is all I can see."},
			{3738339, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_72_m", "I do not know, but we must be cautious, deliberate."},
			{3738340, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_73_m", "The jailous malevolence permeates everything in that tower. If he believes his prize is in jeopardy, he may decide to... discard it."},
			{3738365, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_74_m", "What you ask poses a terrible risk to all of us."},
			{3738366, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_75_m", "I am pleased you are safe, High Chieftain. You need respite. Please sit and bide a moment."},
			{3738367, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_76_m", "With respect, Lady Proudmoore, you need to recover your strength. Let the maw walker resume the search for the others."},
			{3738437, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_77_m", "You assisted me in peering into Torghast once, Maw Walker. That bond may forge a link between us as you search the tower."},
			{3738538, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_78_m", "Each time I gaze into Torghast I sense malevolent eyes staring back. The risk grows ever greater, but we cannot relent."},
			{3738653, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_79_m", "You must venture into the maw and provoke the wrath of the jailer's eye. His rage will draw out the enemy that holds the key to saving Thrall."},
			{3738666, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_80_m", "Morwaka, have you lost your way? Ah, a darkness looming."},
			{3738735, "line", "vo_901_bolvar_81_m", "Beyond God, He senses us."},
			{4072589, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_01_m", "I have seen a vision of where such vessels are kept, but retrieving it will prove perilous. The Jailer keeps his treasures well guarded."},
			{4078898, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_02_m", "The Evernblade will help defend the Eternal City."},
			{4078899, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_03_m", "But this will not be the Jailor's only target."},
			{4078911, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_04_m", "We will rally the Covenant's forces and make our stand."},
			{4079425, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_05_m", "The Nathrezim. Serving the Chila. But they were part of the Burning Legion. At least that's what we were led to believe."},
			{4079426, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_06_m", "The dreadlords are masters of infiltration and illusion. Our covenant forces must remain vigilant."},
			{4079427, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_07_m", "Stay alert, maw walker. They could be... anywhere."},
			{4080035, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_08_m", "Sekitar medics, gather your forces. Secure the vault exterior until the maw walker arrives with Tal'galan."},
			{4080390, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_09_m", "Maw Walker. Polemark Adrestes brings grim tidings from Bastion. You are needed in Oribos at once."},
			{4080391, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_10_m", "Both Ardenweald and Oribos could come under assault. Darien, the Ebon Blade must protect the city."},
			{4080392, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_11_m", "I understand Jaina. We depart at once."},
			{4080393, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_12_m", "I fear we may be too late."},
			{4080394, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_13_m", "Resist him! Do not let the jailer win!"},
			{4080989, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_14_m", "This magic bound with the Primus is sigil. Is it familiar more Walker?"},
			{4080990, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_15_m", "It is much like the memories you restored to the Runecarver in Torghast. If you bring this to him, perhaps he will know how to untangle the sigil."},
			{4080992, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_16_m", "This is our only path forward we have no choice but to try"},
			{4080994, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_17_m", "So be it good luck to you both"},
			{4081113, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_18_m", "We are honored to have you among us, Primus. What is our cause now that the Jailer has your sigil?"},
			{4081411, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_19_m", "Of course, Jaina."},
			{4081430, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_20_m", "Primus, what we witnessed in the Arbiter's chamber, it was beyond mortal understanding."},
			{4081435, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_21_m", "What will his next move be?"},
			{4081539, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_22_m", "We must launch a counter-attack before the morsworn can strike again."},
			{4081540, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_23_m", "We will defend Oribos from the Jailor's forces. Hurry Morwaka, the enemy's strength is growing."},
			{4081555, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_24_m", "Fine work, maw walker."},
			{4081556, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_25_m", "The covenants await your signal."},
			{4081557, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_26_m", "Goodbye Talinara, the Abun Blade will defend Oribos until we return."},
			{4081559, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_27_m", "Good. Then there's no need for introductions. We've come to push back against the Jailer's forces."},
			{4081632, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_28_m", "The Jailer is gone. Wherever that gateway led, it's been sealed behind him."},
			{4081634, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_29_m", "As if her power and the sigil were his all along."},
			{4081638, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_30_m", "My knights will hold her captive here in Oribos. When she awakens, we can begin the interrogation."},
			{4081639, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_31_m", "For now, we should return to Corvia. Let us hope the Primus can explain the Jailer's plan, and tell us what must be done to stop him."},
			{4081766, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_32_m", "The compass is imbued with a memory."},
			{4082290, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_33_m", "By the light, he's expanding the maw around Oribos!"},
			{4082291, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_34_m", "Press the attack! The Jailer must be stopped!"},
			{4082292, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_35_m", "The Banshee is aiming at our heads!"},
			{4082293, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_36_m", "Sylvanas means to claim our heads. Stop her!"},
			{4082317, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_37_m", "Mmm, behind our quarry. Heroes with me!"},
			{4082323, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_38_m", "No! We will stop you!"},
			{4082324, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_39_m", "Jaina, we need a portal."},
			{4082352, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_40_m", "Your crusade ends here, Banshee."},
			{4082353, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_41_m", "This time you'll lose, Sylvanas!"},
			{4082491, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_42_m", "Thrall scout ahead. Champions will assist the admiral."},
			{4082499, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_43_m", "Thrall won't last much longer on his own. We need to reach him."},
			{4082589, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_44_m", "This power is not yours to command!"},
			{4082590, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_45_m", "We're done with your games, Sylvanas."},
			{4082591, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_46_m", "No! The Jailer is going to destroy the Arbiter!"},
			{4093146, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_47_m", "Ebon Blade, hold this position!"},
			{4093148, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_48_m", "The Tara group blocks our way. Champions, it is time for the Jailer's pet to meet its end."},
			{4093149, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_49_m", "Bring down those beasts. You'll need their power to face the Taragru."},
			{4093150, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_50_m", "Secure the area. Fortify our perimeter."},
			{4093151, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_51_m", "Lady Proudmoore, we could use your expertise."},
			{4093153, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_52_m", "Prepare yourselves. The Sanctum of Domination awaits."},
			{4093154, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_53_m", "We will draw their main forces to us. Champions, find a way to thwart the jailer's plan."},
			{4093157, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_55_m", "We will stop you Sylvanas!"},
			{4093158, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_56_m", "Ebon Blade, secure the portal!"},
			{4093159, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_57_m", "The anima used to empower the jailous forges is being harvested on this floor"},
			{4093160, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_58_m", "Release these souls, champions. Deprive our enemy of his greatest resource."},
			{4093161, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_59_m", "This is where the pursuit of power leads, a prison of your own making, tormented by memories of failure."},
			{4093162, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_60_m", "Nezul's cries echoed within the helm when I wore it. There was nobility in him once, before it was twisted into darkness."},
			{4093163, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_61_m", "Grant him the release of Oblivion Champions."},
			{4093164, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_62_m", "Hold this portal!"},
			{4093165, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_63_m", "Almost to the summit, be on your guard!"},
			{4093166, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_64_m", "These devices seem to be pulling other realms into the maw, as was done to Korthia."},
			{4093167, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_65_m", "What else is the jailer looking for?"},
			{4093168, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_66_m", "Knights, secure the chamber."},
			{4093169, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_67_m", "Kel'Thuzad was one of the Jailor's most obedient lapdogs. I will attempt to twist what remains of his power and open a gateway that takes us straight to his master."},
			{4093170, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_68_m", "Activating it will take all my focus. Once you're through, you'll need to face whatever's on the other side."},
			{4093171, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_69_m", "I'll rejoin you as soon as I recover. Together, we'll put an end to the Jailer's threat."},
			{4093172, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_70_m", "There are no more Falkir to protect you Sylvanas. You will die here... for the last time."},
			{4093433, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_71_m", "The eye of the jailer is driven out Good and you've gathered valuable information on desmateron But this news of Helia and Vyraz is troubling"},
			{4093434, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_72_m", "I look forward to seeing Maldraxxi forces in action, Arrhenes."},
			{4093603, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_73_m", "Insidious Banshee!"},
			{4180448, "line", "vo_91_bolvar_74_m", "The Jailer must not take the Eternal City!"},
			{4254143, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_00", "The Jailer He who tormented so many Who long ago set in motion the plague of undeath on our world Has finally been destroyed"},
			{4322417, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_01", "Do whatever you can to aid the Oracle. The fate of the Shadowlands depends on your success."},
			{4323554, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_02", "I believed I would be trapped in that ice forever, holding the scourge at bay. I thought that was the only path left for me. I dared not hope for anything more."},
			{4323555, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_03", "When the helm was broken, and I was free, I... I was afraid."},
			{4323557, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_04", "A few that the daughter I loved with all my heart would find me and see only a monster."},
			{4323559, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_05", "I won't waste this chance, Talia. I promise you."},
			{4323585, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_06", "The man I was did die that day. The dragon's fire sealed my purpose."},
			{4323587, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_07", "Would you have journeyed to Icecrown if you knew?"},
			{4323589, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_08", "Which is why you could not know I Had to make that sacrifice To keep you and the rest of the world safe from that place from that power"},
			{4323591, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_09", "I know, and for the pain it caused you, I will always feel sorrow. I pray that one day, you can forgive me for it."},
			{4323664, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_10", "Without the helm of domination to control them, the Scourge roams leaderless. Nothing remains to temper their aggression."},
			{4323666, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_11", "We cannot allow any of them to seize command and unite their forces. The Ebon Blade must remain vigilant."},
			{4323668, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_12", "Icecrown Citadel remains a seat of dark power. We must not let it fall into enemy hands. Perhaps I should return, too."},
			{4323670, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_13", "Darian, thank you. Strange is it not. We both lived lives of service and even after facing death itself, we still feel compelled to serve others."},
			{4323790, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_14", "Anduin, can you tell us anything about the domination that the Jailer put in our way?"},
			{4323813, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_15", "If we can find a way to resist domination, it is worth the risk."},
			{4323859, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_16", "Taelia and I will join you. Be prepared, champion. That region is entrenched with powerful Mawsworn."},
			{4323874, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_17", "That feeling in your mind is the quality that makes domination less effective."},
			{4323980, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_18", "Who taught you how to wield a hammer?"},
			{4323989, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_19", "Every day."},
			{4323995, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_20", "Look out!"},
			{4324046, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_21", "So be it. Let us see what horrors we will have to relive."},
			{4324049, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_22", "We will need to bring the remaining shards of the helm as well."},
			{4324061, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_23", "We must harness what is within us. There is no other choice."},
			{4324067, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_24", "Ready the Shard!"},
			{4324070, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_25", "Argh! The burning!"},
			{4324137, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_26", "With this reforging, our wills are our own."},
			{4324378, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_28", "We need to know what the Jailer is planning. Darien, take the Covenant forces and make a push from the west."},
			{4324414, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_29", "The Jailer may have sealed the way behind him, but this land is full of mysteries."},
			{4324417, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_30", "There must be another means to enter the Sepulchre. We will not rest until we find it."},
			{4324447, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_31", "Morwaka, we have much to discuss."},
			{4324448, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_32", "I shall deliver the crown of wills to the arbiter then we will bear witness to the fate of Sylvanas Windrunner"},
			{4324754, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_33", "Heaven Blade, hold here."},
			{4324755, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_34", "The entrance lies ahead."},
			{4324756, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_35", "Be wary. The defenses protecting the Sepulchre's secrets will be unlike any you have encountered before."},
			{4324765, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_36", "Maasworn are dominating the Atoma. We will hold them here."},
			{4325085, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_37", "Everblade to me! We march to save the king!"},
			{4325713, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_38", "The way is open. Prepare yourselves. The Jailer is sending his moss warn against us."},
			{4326913, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_39", "You have begun to unravel the mysteries of Zereth Mortis now, we must put this knowledge to use"},
			{4326914, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_40", "I will inform the Primus of your discoveries. His insights will be invaluable."},
			{4326915, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_41", "Yet more remains to be done. Continue to explore this land. Any new information you find may help us turn the tide against the Jailer."},
			{4327351, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_42", "If a new armature is to arise, then there may yet be hope for the Shadowlands. Keep me apprised, Mallwalker."},
			{4329610, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_43", "We cannot allow that to happen."},
			{4329665, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_44", "We are relieved to see you back safe, maw walker."},
			{4330877, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_45", "No, the risk is too great, Uther."},
			{4330886, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_46", "We cannot defeat the Jailer without help from the Enlightened."},
			{4330901, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_47", "Elder Ara, we are in your debt. What do you suggest?"},
			{4332142, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_48", "After your flight from the Arbutus Chamber, we defeated the Nathrezim, but they had sabotaged the gateway."},
			{4332143, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_49", "Once the stain of maw magic had been cleansed, the Primus placed the gateway in this chamber."},
			{4332144, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_50", "He trusted that you would find an anchor on the other side to reactivate it, giving us a path to Cerith Mortis."},
			{4332145, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_51", "Now the true work begins to save Anduin and to prevent the Jailer from remaking reality in his dark image."},
			{4332146, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_52", "The maw walker has opened the way. Covenant forces, forward to Xerith Mortis."},
			{4332154, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_53", "Thank you, Elders. With your aid, we pledge to drive the jailer from Xerith Mortis."},
			{4334557, "line", "vo_920_highlord_bolvar_fordragon_54", "Shandris, you and the maw walker infiltrate the east side and see what you can learn."},
			{4254144, "line", "vo_92_bolvar_02_m", "For years I sat upon the frozen throne, ignorant of its true purpose, using every ounce of my own will to silence the grim whispers of that cursed crown."},
			{4254145, "line", "vo_92_bolvar_03_m", "I believed I was holding back the scourge, and the devastation they would unleash. But I now question if it was all part of his plan."},
			{4254146, "line", "vo_92_bolvar_04_m", "that I was unknowingly playing along in his deception."},
			{4254147, "line", "vo_92_bolvar_05_m", "Yet he failed, thanks to you, you and the countless others who risked everything for our world, and our very survival."},
			{4254148, "line", "vo_92_bolvar_06_m", "The jailer looked upon mortals and saw only flaws But in the end it was our strength that proved his undoing"},
			{4324342, "line", "vo_92_bolvar_34_m", "Elder Kramp, what is the purpose of those obelisks?"},
			{4324354, "line", "vo_92_bolvar_35_m", "Then we must protect the remaining obelisks. Should we fail this realm and all reality will pay the price."},
			{4332148, "line", "vo_92_bolvar_61_m", "Lead on, Mallwalker."},
			{4332149, "line", "vo_92_bolvar_62_m", "So this is Xerath Mortis, the Hidden Heart of the Shadowlands."},
		},
		sound = {
			{568028, "ability", "battleshouttarget"},
			{568646, "ability", "spell_heroicstrike_impact_01"},
			{569534, "ability", "spell_heroicstrike_impact_02"},
			{568349, "ability", "spell_heroicstrike_impact_03"},
			{568732, "ability", "spell_heroicstrike_impact_04"},
			{569542, "ability", "spell_heroicstrike_impact_05"},
			{569694, "ability", "spell_wr_heroicstrike_impact_01"},
			{569327, "ability", "spell_wr_heroicstrike_impact_02"},
			{568872, "ability", "spell_wr_heroicstrike_impact_03"},
			{568223, "ability", "spell_wr_heroicstrike_impact_04"},
			{568878, "ability", "spell_wr_heroicstrike_impact_05"},
		},
	},
	[2] = {
		voice = {
			{553258, "pick", "kingmagnibronzebeardgreeting01", "strength, honor. I see them in you. Why have you come?"},
			{553256, "pick", "kingmagnibronzebeardgreeting02", "What brings you to Ironforge?"},
			{553257, "pick", "kingmagnibronzebeardgreeting03", "How can the dwarves help you?"},
			{553259, "pick", "kingmagnibronzebeardgreeting04", "What do you seek within the mountain?"},
			{553254, "pick", "kingmagnibronzebeardaggro01", "For Kazmodan!"},
			{553255, "pick", "kingmagnibronzebeardaggro02", "Feel the fury of the mountain!"},
			{5715297, "pick", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_06_m", "We must forge ahead!"},
			{5715296, "pick", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_05_m", "Champion! Good to see you!"},
			{5715293, "pick", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_02_m", "I'm ready for anything!"},
			{5715300, "pick", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_09_m", "Who knows what we'll find deep in the earth!"},
			{5715478, "pick", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_28_m", "Always more work to be done."},
			{5715480, "pick", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_30_m", "Sometimes Destiny whispers, sometimes she shouts."},
			{2147541, "shout", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_battleshout_01", "YEAH!!!"},
			{2147543, "shout", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_battleshout_02", "AHHHHHHHHHHHHHH!"},
			{6118385, "line", "vo_1107_magni_bronzebeard_01_m", "Well, best be setting sail to Ironforge, no sense in dawdling."},
			{6118400, "line", "vo_1107_magni_bronzebeard_02_m", "Argh! And who is this?"},
			{6118406, "line", "vo_1107_magni_bronzebeard_03_m", "Goddess? You mean Azeroth? Aye, I was her speaker for many years, but she's let me go from that service."},
			{6118412, "line", "vo_1107_magni_bronzebeard_04_m", "Aye, it can be lonely following a path that others can't see, but don't make the same mistake I did, putting it all on yourself."},
			{6118415, "line", "vo_1107_magni_bronzebeard_05_m", "Look for those who will walk the path with you. If I've learned anything, it's that we'll always need each other to not lose ourselves on the journey."},
			{6118421, "line", "vo_1107_magni_bronzebeard_06_m", "Best of luck to you, Orwena. One day, when you found what you're looking for, I hope you too find your way home."},
			{5715292, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_01_m", "Smooth, isn't it? Who'd have thought it'd be like a wee bairn's bottom underneath?"},
			{5715294, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_03_m", "Prefer all diplomatic questions to my daughter, Moira!"},
			{5715295, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_04_m", "Magni! In the flesh!"},
			{5715298, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_07_m", "Azeroth still needs us!"},
			{5715299, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_08_m", "Ah, glad you're here."},
			{5782488, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_100_m", "Come and get some, you kite-less bastard!"},
			{5782707, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_101_m", "edicts, oath sworn, it all sounds daft to me."},
			{5784072, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_102_m", "Get those doors open lad, and fast."},
			{5784074, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_103_m", "All this garden, twisted into something they never asked to become."},
			{5784079, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_104_m", "I'll be damned if I let Brin's people be turned into monsters!"},
			{5784081, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_105_m", "I've seen rooms like this before! There's Titan Machinery in here!"},
			{5784089, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_106_m", "I know a lot. I know."},
			{5786125, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_107_m", "I'm coming with you, lad. Prince, we'll be back soon."},
			{5786129, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_108_m", "This isn't one of your books, lad. Watch your step."},
			{5786136, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_109_m", "I doubt it. The entrance has boarded up."},
			{5715301, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_10_m", "Whatever my people need me, I will go."},
			{5786138, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_110_m", "I know you want to help lad, but this is a ghost town!"},
			{5786141, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_111_m", "Sounded like another deep flare. Let's move on."},
			{5786142, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_112_m", "Fewer workers, it would seem. Is it because the earthen are shutting down?"},
			{5786147, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_113_m", "The forge is still hot. Someone was here recently."},
			{5786153, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_114_m", "It came from that building!"},
			{5786154, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_115_m", "Enough knocking, champion! We're breaking this thing down!"},
			{5786157, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_116_m", "Dagarin, it's time to go."},
			{5786170, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_117_m", "Wait, I can hear wind blowing, from beyond the stone."},
			{5786171, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_118_m", "It must have been a controlled cave-in! Champion, help us destroy the blockage!"},
			{5786172, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_119_m", "Is that... the Foreman? You were right, lad!"},
			{5715302, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_11_m", "We cannot give in. We must keep fighting."},
			{5786173, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_120_m", "Come on, we can't let that thing out of this cave!"},
			{5786174, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_121_m", "We were... too late. How many times have I been too late?"},
			{5786180, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_122_m", "We have to tell Brents! Hurry!"},
			{5788318, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_123_m", "You"},
			{5788343, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_124_m", "What changed your mind?"},
			{5791152, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_125_m", "SPEAK TO ME!"},
			{5791155, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_126_m", "The place she's calling us to!"},
			{5836853, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_127_m", "Ugh!"},
			{5836854, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_128_m", "We'll help you."},
			{5836855, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_129_m", "We're here to help!"},
			{5715303, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_12_m", "I would never succeed without my clan and family."},
			{5836857, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_130_m", "What's happening to them?"},
			{5836860, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_131_m", "Stay back, GLAAD!"},
			{5836863, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_132_m", "Get away from him!"},
			{5836864, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_133_m", "Aaargh!"},
			{5836870, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_134_m", "I don't know."},
			{5836871, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_135_m", "We'll figure it out later."},
			{5836872, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_136_m", "I can hear more coming."},
			{5846746, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_137_m", "AHHH!"},
			{5847087, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_138_m", "What are you trying to tell us?"},
			{5715304, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_13_m", "Azeroth depends on us."},
			{5715305, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_14_m", "KEEP LISTIN'!"},
			{5715306, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_15_m", "Everyone deserves a second chance."},
			{5715466, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_16_m", "If you're trying to polish me, put a wee bit more elbow grease in. Here, see, wax on, wax off, wax on, wax off."},
			{5715467, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_17_m", "I got no counsel for you! No advice!"},
			{5715468, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_18_m", "Look, I'm not dead yet!"},
			{5715469, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_19_m", "SPEAK UP!"},
			{5715470, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_20_m", "Even though I'm bone to serving Azeroth."},
			{5715471, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_21_m", "I'm speaking for no one these days."},
			{5715472, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_22_m", "Well, out with it."},
			{5715473, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_23_m", "For Azeroth."},
			{5715474, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_24_m", "I'll press on till Azeroth is done with me."},
			{5715475, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_25_m", "No rest for we heroes, hey champion!"},
			{5715476, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_26_m", "Eh, off with ya."},
			{5715477, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_27_m", "Keep fighting, champion!"},
			{5715479, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_29_m", "When the world is healed, may some healing be spent on me."},
			{5715673, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_31_m", "You"},
			{5715674, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_32_m", "You"},
			{5715675, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_33_m", "You"},
			{5715676, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_34_m", "You"},
			{5715677, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_35_m", "You"},
			{5715678, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_36_m", "You"},
			{5715679, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_37_m", "You"},
			{5715680, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_38_m", "You"},
			{5715681, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_39_m", "You"},
			{5715682, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_40_m", "You"},
			{5715683, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_41_m", "You"},
			{5715684, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_42_m", "You"},
			{5715685, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_43_m", "Azeroth!"},
			{5715686, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_44_m", "I can hear her voice!"},
			{5715687, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_45_m", "I can see it!"},
			{5715688, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_46_m", "IT'S COLD!"},
			{5715689, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_47_m", "AHHHHHHHHHH"},
			{5715690, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_48_m", "Azeroth showed me a vision of a city in flames in the ancient lands of Khaz'algar."},
			{5715691, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_49_m", "Her voice was desperate. We must act quickly!"},
			{5723099, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_50_m", "I lost, but I saw a vision of destruction."},
			{5723100, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_51_m", "And the name, Kaz Algar."},
			{5723403, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_52_m", "Moira, can I speak with you?"},
			{5723405, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_53_m", "I can see that better than I would have done with these machines."},
			{5723406, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_54_m", "I just wanted to say, I'm proud of you."},
			{5723408, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_55_m", "No! And I deserve that. I've done some things I'm not proud of."},
			{5723409, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_56_m", "But in spite of me, you've grown up to have a keen mind for governing and the heart to let Dagram be the man he'll be."},
			{5723413, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_57_m", "I only wanted to protect you, and I've not done a good job of it, we're in grave danger, even now."},
			{5723414, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_58_m", "But you don't need me anymore, and it does me good to see how strong you are."},
			{5723415, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_59_m", "And that when I'm gone, you'll carry on and rule with a grace and strength I could only dream about."},
			{5723493, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_60_m", "How I look, to be honest, the shine has worn off of me, and of this speaker nonsense."},
			{5723495, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_61_m", "An honour, aye, until it wasn't, A song everywhere, a nary a peep for me."},
			{5723496, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_62_m", "And now drag to the ends of the earth and my family too!"},
			{5723498, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_63_m", "Right, you're in the same boat, aren't you lad? But the light seems a fairer master. I doubt it has left you truly endowin'."},
			{5723500, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_64_m", "That may be. But if I were you, I'd enjoy my break from being a king and saviour of the world. Figure yourself out. Rest."},
			{5723817, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_65_m", "Diagram, lad, I'm concerned about you."},
			{5723822, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_66_m", "Oh, it does my heart good to see you! So excited about this! But I'm concerned about your safety!"},
			{5723827, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_67_m", "Oh, you've got a good eye for solving problems, lad, but not for danger. You've got a brave heart, but you're reckless."},
			{5723830, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_68_m", "Sometimes I think you're so distracted figuring things out that you leap before you look."},
			{5723835, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_69_m", "Me? What do you mean?"},
			{5723839, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_70_m", "Aye, I've had a burden to bear for too long. I just don't want you to get hurt, lad."},
			{5723847, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_71_m", "Hahaha, aye lad. I'll enjoy them even more when I'm with you. It's a deal."},
			{5724109, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_72_m", "Needn't you mind? Had a stray thought. Thank you for jogging my memory."},
			{5724111, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_73_m", "Azeroth, you fox. Did you do this on purpose? To pave the way here for us?"},
			{5724113, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_74_m", "These other Threigar, they look akin to me."},
			{5724132, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_75_m", "duties. I, um, can you refresh my memory of what those are?"},
			{5724134, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_76_m", "Uh-huh. Oh, right. Me? Oh, yes, yes, yes. A thing out of old I am."},
			{5724273, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_77_m", "Ah, I've got a lot to make up for. For a long time, I knew I needed to protect Azeroth."},
			{5724280, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_78_m", "I gave up a lot. I gave up too much. I should have spent more time protecting you and daggering."},
			{5724290, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_79_m", "I know. I want to be here for him as his granda."},
			{5724295, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_80_m", "I wasn't responsible enough. That needs to change."},
			{5724300, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_81_m", "I've spent too many years listening to Azeroth's voice. I'm glad I can listen to yours now."},
			{5724647, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_82_m", "I feel humbled, like I've carried a burden for a long time, like I've finally been forgiven. I've had debts to pay."},
			{5724665, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_83_m", "Alas, my old life, I can't live my life that way."},
			{5724677, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_84_m", "I understand. I've changed, and my life has changed. I don't want to live in the past. I want our family to have a future."},
			{5724688, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_85_m", "Onward and upward. On to the next adventure."},
			{5738689, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_86_m", "If this is about the visions, I'm near interested. Leave me alone!"},
			{5738691, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_87_m", "Speaker of Azeroth! Pfft! She hasn't been speaking to me!"},
			{5738692, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_88_m", "After all I gave, she left me like this, unable to feel the warmth of my kin's embrace."},
			{5738693, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_89_m", "So, let's be clear, I'm doing this for all of you, not for her!"},
			{5768102, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_90_m", "You"},
			{5779287, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_91_m", "Ah, Laddie, we're not chasing magic, that!"},
			{5779289, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_92_m", "You've seen others akin to me?"},
			{5779291, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_93_m", "Now don't you be talking to my daughter like that, ya great stone!"},
			{5779301, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_94_m", "We can't even hold them!"},
			{5779340, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_95_m", "Do you think the Arathe are here somewhere in Kazulgar?"},
			{5779342, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_96_m", "I don't know what to make of it, the earthen are also an ancient people, they might be just remembering ghosts."},
			{5779343, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_97_m", "Aye, I heard that too."},
			{5779345, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_98_m", "Oh, you know, titans, edicts, phragga..."},
			{5779347, "line", "vo_110_magni_bronzebeard_99_m", "These earthen, they're a funny lot, odd traditions, superstitions."},
			{1445274, "line", "vo_703_magni_bronzebeard_01_m", "You"},
			{1445299, "line", "vo_703_magni_bronzebeard_02_m", "You"},
			{1445302, "line", "vo_703_magni_bronzebeard_03_m", "You"},
			{1445303, "line", "vo_703_magni_bronzebeard_04_m", "You"},
			{1445306, "line", "vo_703_magni_bronzebeard_05_m", "You"},
			{1445308, "line", "vo_703_magni_bronzebeard_06_m", "You"},
			{1445309, "line", "vo_703_magni_bronzebeard_07_m", "You"},
			{1445311, "line", "vo_703_magni_bronzebeard_08_m", "You"},
			{1445325, "line", "vo_703_magni_bronzebeard_09_m", "You"},
			{1445326, "line", "vo_703_magni_bronzebeard_10_m", "You"},
			{1445328, "line", "vo_703_magni_bronzebeard_11_m", "You"},
			{1445330, "line", "vo_703_magni_bronzebeard_12_m", "You"},
			{1445333, "line", "vo_703_magni_bronzebeard_13_m", "You"},
			{1445335, "line", "vo_703_magni_bronzebeard_14_m", "You"},
			{1624282, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_01_m", "She is trying to send me a message. A warning, he thinks. But something's not right with her."},
			{1624283, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_02_m", "Meet me and show us our basin up in Northrend. Together, we'll get to the bottom of this."},
			{1624284, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_03_m", "A shame Bran didn't come with you. Nothing my brother loves more than openin' Titan doors."},
			{1624285, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_04_m", "I sense her fear. Her doubt. We've got to help her. Looks like some of the defenses are down. If you reactivate them, it might help snap her out of this."},
			{1624286, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_05_m", "You did it! The nightmares are contained! Keep going. I'm just ahead in the next chamber."},
			{1624287, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_06_m", "Champion! Azeroth needs her help!"},
			{1624288, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_07_m", "Ah, you're getting close. Come to the Maker's Overlook, high in the eastern mountains. I'll show you the way inside."},
			{1624289, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_08_m", "Here you go. This pad'll bring you deep below ground to a place no mortal has walked in millennia. The Hall of Communion. Come on down. I've got a lot to show you."},
			{1624290, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_09_m", "Lately, she seemed troubled, hard to read. I hope you can help me get through to her."},
			{1624291, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_10_m", "Something's triggered the defences! Careful now, you've got company!"},
			{1624292, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_11_m", "These phantoms must be her dreams, her nightmares. If we help her overcome these horrors, Azeroth should be able to give us her message."},
			{1624293, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_12_m", "Talk to me lass, tell me what's got you all in a tizzy."},
			{1624294, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_13_m", "The Dark Titan comes. We've got to stop him. Argus, the Legion's homeworld, she says her destiny lies there."},
			{1624295, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_14_m", "Her feelings are a jumble. I need to focus. Let her thoughts flow into... Ah!"},
			{1624296, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_15_m", "Sands soaked in pain, rivers, rivers of blood."},
			{1624297, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_16_m", "Skies, a flame, a sword, and the darkness, the wind is burning."},
			{1624298, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_17_m", "Sssssssss Cuban"},
			{1624299, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_18_m", "Talking to her old soul ain't like chatting with a mortal. Might be why she needed someone to become her speaker."},
			{1624300, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_19_m", "She's haunted by the Legion and the Old Gods, but there be something more. A greater darkness!"},
			{1624301, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_20_m", "Looks like we've got some preparing to do, champion. You best tell Khadgar what we've learned. Good luck!"},
			{1624302, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_21_m", "The titans built these halls to watch over the soul of the world. From this chamber, I can hear her, clear as diamond."},
			{1624303, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_22_m", "It is good to see you! Now that the nightmares are gone, we can find out what she wants to tell us. Give the word and we'll begin."},
			{1624304, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_23_m", "All right, I got everything set up on this end. Activate the power conduits and the pad will be operational."},
			{1624305, "line", "vo_725_magni_bronzebeard_24_m", "That's it. Her thoughts be clearing up. She's feeling... fear. Watch out!"},
			{1584059, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_01_m", "Not so much in words. Tismor! Feelings. But not like feelings you or I would have."},
			{1584060, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_02_m", "Well, let's say you're a world soul, eh? What sort of feelings do you suppose you'd have? Sometimes you feel like a crumbling mountain range, and sometimes you feel like a deep dark sea. I don't know exactly how to describe it."},
			{1584062, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_03_m", "It felt... like a sunrise."},
			{1584065, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_04_m", "Revola Rook Mayez Amir!"},
			{1584067, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_05_m", "They must be activated simultaneously. High priest, would you do the honors?"},
			{1584074, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_06_m", "Seekers! Yes! That must be what she meant when she directed me to this place! She wanted us to find these creatures!"},
			{1584079, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_07_m", "So what happened to them?"},
			{1584084, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_08_m", "Again? You've done this before, brother?"},
			{1584086, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_09_m", "Erm, stop it then, will ya?"},
			{1584091, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_10_m", "I sense some corruption amongst my brethren, watch yourself for purification!"},
			{1584092, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_11_m", "Many will come this time. The machine surges with light!"},
			{1584095, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_12_m", "You're wrong about that, Lass. This is why Azeroth called me. Called us here."},
			{1584096, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_13_m", "She knew it wouldn't be long before the void or took this chamber. She knew who would protect these creatures and use them in service of the Light."},
			{1584097, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_14_m", "It is you, high priest."},
			{1588519, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_15_m", "I speak for Azeroth!"},
			{1588520, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_16_m", "Well met!"},
			{1588521, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_17_m", "These stones have tales to tell!"},
			{1588522, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_18_m", "Fight for our world!"},
			{1588523, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_19_m", "For Azeroth!"},
			{1588524, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_20_m", "Back to work!"},
			{1588525, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_21_m", "HENAFIAN NONSENSE!"},
			{1588526, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_22_m", "My magma's fixing to boil!"},
			{1588527, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_23_m", "You messin' with the voice of the planet? THE PLANET!"},
			{1588528, "line", "vo_72_magni_bronzebeard_24_m", "Now you've done it, it's clobbering time!"},
			{1793336, "line", "vo_735_magni_bronzebeard_01_m", "Champion, it is good to see a familiar face in these dark times."},
			{1793337, "line", "vo_735_magni_bronzebeard_02_m", "Since returning from Argus, the cries of Azeroth have been... overwhelming. Such pain."},
			{1793338, "line", "vo_735_magni_bronzebeard_03_m", "I don't know how to fix this, not sure anyone does, but we've got to keep trying."},
			{1793339, "line", "vo_735_magni_bronzebeard_04_m", "The Storm's Gathering hero, if we don't find a way to heal Azeroth, nothing else is gonna matter."},
			{1793340, "line", "vo_735_magni_bronzebeard_05_m", "Champions, you unified your orders and fought together to drive the Legion from Azeroth."},
			{1793341, "line", "vo_735_magni_bronzebeard_06_m", "I know tensions are rising, but I'm calling on you to stand together once more!"},
			{1793342, "line", "vo_735_magni_bronzebeard_07_m", "Come to Silithus, while we still have a world left to fight for!"},
			{1793343, "line", "vo_735_magni_bronzebeard_08_m", "The Sword of Sargeras is poisoning the very lifeblood of the world."},
			{1793344, "line", "vo_735_magni_bronzebeard_09_m", "The only vessels capable of containing that kind of power are the mighty weapons you wield!"},
			{1793345, "line", "vo_735_magni_bronzebeard_10_m", "Raise them up as one! Draw out the corruption from the Dark Titan's blade!"},
			{1793346, "line", "vo_735_magni_bronzebeard_11_m", "Together, champions, for Azeroth!"},
			{1793347, "line", "vo_735_magni_bronzebeard_12_m", "You did it! Sargeras's sword has gone dormant. Now, Azeroth's not yet healed, but your actions bought us precious time."},
			{1793348, "line", "vo_735_magni_bronzebeard_13_m", "The energy coursing through that weapon of yours, I ain't seen nothin' like it! But remember, all power comes with a price."},
			{1793349, "line", "vo_735_magni_bronzebeard_14_m", "I know there's much to face in the days ahead, but no matter what comes, never forget our duty to Azeroth!"},
			{1689468, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_01_m", "I feel Argus' soul calling to me again. He's frantic, desperate, and sad, so bloody sad, it breaks my heart."},
			{1689469, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_02_m", "Place your hand upon the stone when you're ready."},
			{1689470, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_03_m", "Sargeras is building some kind of dark pantheon. We've got to find Aenar's spirit before Aggramar does."},
			{1689471, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_04_m", "The life binder! Somehow, she's the key to Sargeras' plan!"},
			{1689472, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_05_m", "We must find her soul! I just don't know how!"},
			{1689473, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_06_m", "This soul fragment calls to me again, but something's different this time. It ain't Argus speaking. It's... another."},
			{1689474, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_07_m", "It's fainter than the breath of the wind, but it feels so familiar to me. It's like Azeroth's call only, it ain't her."},
			{1689475, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_08_m", "When Azeroth's spirit speaks to me, it's like a song. There's beauty in it, even when her message ain't exactly clear."},
			{1689476, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_09_m", "Argus' soul ain't like that. He's tormented, broken. Careful, or his pain'll overwhelm you."},
			{1689477, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_10_m", "He... He needs us to see something."},
			{1689478, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_11_m", "Agramar! The fallen titan now serves Sargeras! This is bad. Very bad!"},
			{1689961, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_12_m", "Something ain't right with this place. A presence calls to me from somewhere deep inside the earth."},
			{1689963, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_13_m", "Champions! I heard a familiar voice calling, so I've fought my way inside this accursed place!"},
			{1689964, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_14_m", "It's A.N.R. The Life Binder. This portal leads to our sanctuary. Go! I'll stay here, cover your backs."},
			{1689965, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_15_m", "Ser Geras seeks to corrupt the other titans. If we don't stop him, the pantheon will be reborn in darkness. There's no time to waste."},
			{1692875, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_16_m", "The souls of the Pantheon are free, but they endured so much suffering. Let me bide with them for a time, offer a bit of comfort."},
			{1692882, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_17_m", "So much agony here, so many voices, it's nearly overwhelming, but I can feel ANR urging us forward."},
			{1692889, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_18_m", "I feel those demons twisting the spirits of the titans, forcing them to use their might to serve the Legion!"},
			{1692891, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_19_m", "Azeroth!"},
			{1693362, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_20_m", "I'll do what I can to ease the titan spirits, while you put an end to their tortures!"},
			{1693363, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_21_m", "They're using Amunthol's mastery of time against you!"},
			{1693364, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_22_m", "The coven's torments of the high father have taken form!"},
			{1693365, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_23_m", "Golgareth! He's lost in a storm of agony!"},
			{1693366, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_24_m", "The coven strikes at you through the storms of Golganeth!"},
			{1693367, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_25_m", "Cazgrós well is being twisted! He can't control his flame!"},
			{1693368, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_26_m", "The demons are turning the Shapers' flames against you!"},
			{1693369, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_27_m", "They're tearing Norganin's mind to pieces!"},
			{1693370, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_28_m", "Careful! Mortals ain't meant to walk the Dreamweaver's path!"},
			{1693441, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_29_m", "You did it! Agramar's essence is free! He can stand beside his brethren once more!"},
			{1693443, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_30_m", "The titans can sever that connection, but not here. They need to bring the soul of Argus to their place of power, the seat of the Pantheon."},
			{1693445, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_31_m", "The final act will harness the last of Argus's power to imprison Sargeras once and for all."},
			{1693446, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_32_m", "I can signal the titans to begin."},
			{1693458, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_33_m", "You"},
			{1693497, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_34_m", "A sword in the darkness, sands soaked in pain."},
			{1693498, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_35_m", "The wound burning, burning!"},
			{1697429, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_36_m", "He's fighting through the pain to let us see."},
			{1697431, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_37_m", "The voice is alone, weak, but so beautiful."},
			{1717098, "line", "vo_73_magni_bronzebeard_38_m", "All right everybody, hold on!"},
			{1963578, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_01_m", "Our world needs us, champion!"},
			{1963579, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_02_m", "Azeroth cries out in pain"},
			{1963580, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_03_m", "Her world must be healed.\""},
			{1963581, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_04_m", "Remember your duty to Azeroth."},
			{1963582, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_05_m", "You mean to tell me there's an enormous sword stabbed into the heart of the planet and you've got time to sit around poking me for a laugh? Get back to work!"},
			{2022919, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_06_m", "If only they were using their power to heal Azeroth instead of hurt her, good work champion!"},
			{2022920, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_07_m", "Some earth elementals have been infused with Azirite and are going crazy! Put them down and absorb their Azirite!"},
			{2022921, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_08_m", "It's a shame that Azerite is driving the elements out of control. More reason for us to be putting an end to this."},
			{2022922, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_09_m", "I can sense Azerite nearby. And those who would seek to abuse it for their own ends, you've got to stop him!"},
			{2022923, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_10_m", "The heart of Azeroth is stronger now, thanks to you, we're one step closer to curing Azeroth of her wounds."},
			{2022924, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_11_m", "Several Azerite wounds lay exposed nearby. Use the Heart of Azeroth to mend them!"},
			{2022925, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_12_m", "You did well, Champion! I can feel Azeroth recovering her strength, thanks to you!"},
			{2022926, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_13_m", "There's a powerful monstrosity nearby, fueled by the blood of Azeroth herself. You've got to destroy it before it does any harm."},
			{2022927, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_14_m", "Watch yourself, there's something strong around here, and it's empowered by Azerite!"},
			{2022928, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_15_m", "That's one less blight we need to worry about!"},
			{2022929, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_16_m", "Azeroth is a bit safer, thanks to your efforts!"},
			{2022930, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_17_m", "The heart of Azeroth is the key to healing our world, but you'll need to gather more power if we're to have any chance of succeeding."},
			{2022931, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_18_m", "Wounds are opening across the face of Azeroth, and more forces are seeking to claim the Azerite for their own ends."},
			{2022932, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_19_m", "You need to stop them, and absorb that Azerite to empower the heart!"},
			{2022933, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_20_m", "You"},
			{2022934, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_21_m", "Now, unleash the heart's power!"},
			{2022935, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_22_m", "I've got something our champion needs to see, a gift that can aid this land as well."},
			{2022936, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_23_m", "Come champion, Azeroth herself beckons!"},
			{2022937, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_24_m", "Ah! There you are, champion! I must have words with you!"},
			{2022938, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_25_m", "No need to panic, though I suppose my entrance was a bit abrupt. The name's Magni Bronzebeard. I speak for Azeroth!"},
			{2022939, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_26_m", "Ah! This can take us where we need to go! Come along, champion!"},
			{2022982, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_27_m", "Someone's drawing power from Azerite in this area. You need to stop him!"},
			{2032614, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_28_m", "Azeroth calls to you champion. She offers a gift one born of her own essence"},
			{2032615, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_29_m", "I may be her speaker, but you are her champion and she needs you to fight for her."},
			{2032616, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_30_m", "The very heart of Azeroth!"},
			{2032617, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_31_m", "Infuse this amulet with power. It might be the only way to save her."},
			{2032618, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_32_m", "Keep that amulet close to your heart, champion. It'll see you through the dark times ahead."},
			{2032619, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_33_m", "I'll keep searching for ways to heal the damage done to Azeroth. When I have need of you, I can reach out through that talisman."},
			{2032620, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_34_m", "Well, hero, you've got work to do. The teleportation pad will take you back to your allies. Good luck to all of us."},
			{2032635, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_35_m", "Oh, this chamber is in ruins, champion, that won't hold together for long."},
			{2057999, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_36_m", "I've got something our champion needs to see, a gift that can aid the people of this land."},
			{2066809, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_37_m", "Champion, I need to speak with you in Silithus. More must be done to heal her world."},
			{2067083, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_38_m", "If you use your amulet to absorb the Azerite, its power should mend the chamber's seal."},
			{2067084, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_39_m", "The seal in this chamber protects the world's soul, but with all this Azerite bursting through, the seal is close to shattering!"},
			{2118733, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_40_m", "I sense Azerite nearby, and something drawing a great deal of power from it. You need to stop it!"},
			{2118734, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_41_m", "Excellent! I sense the power returning to Azeroth already!"},
			{2118735, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_42_m", "Someone in this cave is mining Azerite from the world's open wounds. Put a stop to it!"},
			{2118736, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_43_m", "Such a shame, putting their own grid before the health of Azeroth. Thank you, champion!"},
			{2125276, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_44_m", "That's it! I think it's working!"},
			{2125277, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_45_m", "Keep going, just a wee bit more!"},
			{2125278, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_46_m", "No! The seal is shattering! Hold on, lass! Please, hold on!"},
			{2125279, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_47_m", "You did it, champion! The chamber is secure!"},
			{2125304, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_48_m", "Champion, Azeroth cries out for your aid. Come to Silithus, there's something you need to see."},
			{2125305, "line", "vo_801_magni_bronzebeard_49_m", "The entrance to the chamber is this way. Come on!"},
			{2736721, "line", "vo_815_magni_bronzebeard_01_m", "What?! That thing could barely carry us when I wasn't made of diamond! Ha! I'll take my chances on the ground!"},
			{2736722, "line", "vo_815_magni_bronzebeard_02_m", "I'll meet you inside, oh dear. BRUN! FLY SAFE!"},
			{2736761, "line", "vo_815_magni_bronzebeard_03_m", "Ugh! Whatever happens, our champion can handle it! Be ready!"},
			{2736762, "line", "vo_815_magni_bronzebeard_04_m", "Something's not right! We're losing her!"},
			{2736764, "line", "vo_815_magni_bronzebeard_05_m", "Take it down or we are done for!"},
			{2736765, "line", "vo_815_magni_bronzebeard_06_m", "You did it! Hahaha! Hold on! We're getting her out of here!"},
			{2736766, "line", "vo_815_magni_bronzebeard_07_m", "Now that we've brought you here, can you find a way to heal Azeroth?"},
			{2736767, "line", "vo_815_magni_bronzebeard_08_m", "Just for analysis? How long before we have a plan of action?"},
			{2736768, "line", "vo_815_magni_bronzebeard_09_m", "Well, at least there's a start. Thank you, champion. You'll be the first to know when mother finds an answer."},
			{2737139, "line", "vo_815_magni_bronzebeard_10_m", "Please to meet you. I'm Magneo!"},
			{2737140, "line", "vo_815_magni_bronzebeard_11_m", "Exactly! We need your help, mother. Azeroth's dying and nothing we do seems to heal her."},
			{2737142, "line", "vo_815_magni_bronzebeard_12_m", "Well, you heard the champion! Let's get to it!"},
			{3049044, "line", "vo_825_magni_bronzebeard_01_m", "Hold it together Ebenhorn, don't give in to them!"},
			{3049050, "line", "vo_825_magni_bronzebeard_02_m", "Champion! We've got a problem! Ebenhorn, he..."},
			{3049051, "line", "vo_825_magni_bronzebeard_03_m", "No! Don't sanitize! Champion, you've got to get back to the chamber right now!"},
			{3049052, "line", "vo_825_magni_bronzebeard_04_m", "Mother! Why'd you do that?"},
			{3049053, "line", "vo_825_magni_bronzebeard_05_m", "I suppose Rathian doesn't want to be found, but the knowledge he's accrued could be critical in the fight against N'zoth."},
			{3049054, "line", "vo_825_magni_bronzebeard_06_m", "Thank you, champion. I'll get to tracking down the Black Prince. Not too many places you can hide when Azeroth's own speaker is looking for you."},
			{3049055, "line", "vo_825_magni_bronzebeard_07_m", "Champion, we need you back in the chamber at once. Ebenhorn's almost gone."},
			{3049056, "line", "vo_825_magni_bronzebeard_08_m", "Mother's opened the wake gate to get you back here. Hurry."},
			{2981973, "line", "vo_82_magni_bronzebeard_01_m", "When Azeroth called me to be her speaker, she sensed a time of great darkness drawing near."},
			{2981974, "line", "vo_82_magni_bronzebeard_02_m", "Through the rise of unspeakable evil, we've clung to a single hope."},
			{2981975, "line", "vo_82_magni_bronzebeard_03_m", "You, champion! You are Azeroth's hope!"},
			{2981976, "line", "vo_82_magni_bronzebeard_04_m", "Thanks to all you've done, that amulet has become mightier than we ever thought possible!"},
			{2981977, "line", "vo_82_magni_bronzebeard_05_m", "Now, let's get back to saving this world!"},
			{2988421, "line", "vo_82_magni_bronzebeard_06_m", "Tell our champion what you've found, mother!"},
			{2988423, "line", "vo_82_magni_bronzebeard_07_m", "Amplify it, you see. How?"},
			{2988424, "line", "vo_82_magni_bronzebeard_08_m", "The dragon aspects! But they gave up their powers to save the world from Deathwing!"},
			{2988425, "line", "vo_82_magni_bronzebeard_09_m", "We've got a lead on where to find the first of these essences!"},
			{2988695, "line", "vo_82_magni_bronzebeard_10_m", "Champion! Mother has a new plan to save Azeroth! Meet us in the Chamber of Heart as soon as you can!"},
			{2988696, "line", "vo_82_magni_bronzebeard_11_m", "Oh, you're back, champion! And you brought... a tauren!"},
			{2988697, "line", "vo_82_magni_bronzebeard_12_m", "Ah! It's good to meet a black dragon that isn't trying to kill us all! Abyssian, is it? I'm Magni Bronzebeard!"},
			{2988698, "line", "vo_82_magni_bronzebeard_13_m", "Did you recover the essence that Mother detected?"},
			{2988699, "line", "vo_82_magni_bronzebeard_14_m", "You understand the essence better than we do, Eben Horne. We'd be grateful for any guidance you can provide."},
			{2988700, "line", "vo_82_magni_bronzebeard_15_m", "There you are, champion. We've made repairs to the Chamber of Heart since you were last here."},
			{2989235, "line", "vo_82_magni_bronzebeard_16_m", "Are you ready, champion?"},
			{2992383, "line", "vo_82_magni_bronzebeard_17_m", "Do you feel that, champion? The heart of Azeroth is brimming with power from the world tree! This is incredible!"},
			{2992384, "line", "vo_82_magni_bronzebeard_18_m", "Champion! The heart of Azeroth has absorbed a massive amount of power from the Maelstrom! It's stronger than ever before!"},
			{2992385, "line", "vo_82_magni_bronzebeard_19_m", "Caligos! Well, this is certainly a welcome surprise! What brings you to the Chamber of Heart?"},
			{3159970, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_01_m", "You"},
			{3164817, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_02_m", "Bran, do you make it back to Ironforge often?"},
			{3164819, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_03_m", "Well, it's just, uh, Moira, how has she been?"},
			{3164821, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_04_m", "Aye, you're right. It's just, in some ways it's easier talking to a planet than it is speaking to my own daughter."},
			{3164823, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_05_m", "I am a plan to, for her mum's sake, and my own."},
			{3165227, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_06_m", "I know we've got a grim battle ahead of us, but it feels good to be swinging a hammer again."},
			{3165229, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_07_m", "After all the pain the old gods have inflicted upon Azeroth, I have to do my part in giving him some payback."},
			{3168015, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_08_m", "Over here, champion! I think I've found who took control of the Forge!"},
			{3168016, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_09_m", "No time to waste! We've got a Titan Forge to reboot!"},
			{3196400, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_100_m", "We're under attack! Protect the chamber!"},
			{3196403, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_101_m", "There's no end to them!"},
			{3196404, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_102_m", "He's... gone."},
			{3196406, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_103_m", "We need to save him! Mother, can you find us another way inside?"},
			{3196408, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_104_m", "Hold on Raden, we are coming for ya!"},
			{3196770, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_105_m", "You"},
			{3197063, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_106_m", "Thirty-seven! That can't be enough to keep Azeroth protected!"},
			{3197064, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_107_m", "It looks like your work isn't done, champion!"},
			{3197073, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_108_m", "Nicely done, hero. Now to get this thing running again."},
			{3197074, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_109_m", "Well, that's a good sign!"},
			{3168017, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_10_m", "Oh, it's been ages since I've held a hammer in my hands. Feels good to be back in the action."},
			{3197075, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_110_m", "Reactivating the engine now! Well, let me see if I can find a console or something for you!"},
			{3197076, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_111_m", "There we go! You can use that console to connect us to the Chamber of Heart."},
			{3197077, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_112_m", "Hold your horses, lass! This thing didn't exactly come with instructions!"},
			{3197078, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_113_m", "Ouch! That stung!"},
			{3197079, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_114_m", "Wait! It all makes sense now! Connecting the power circuit!"},
			{3197080, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_115_m", "What's this? Interesting! I'll remember that for later!"},
			{3197081, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_116_m", "There! The link is up!"},
			{3197082, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_117_m", "We did it, hero! The Forge is drawing power from the engine of Nalak Shah!"},
			{3197083, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_118_m", "And I found something in the archives that could turn the tide against N'zoth!"},
			{3197084, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_119_m", "Come on, let's get back to the high keeper."},
			{3168021, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_11_m", "Looks like we'll have to fight our way through. Let's get moving."},
			{3197119, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_120_m", "Sorry to string that on you lad, but before we go, I have a favour to ask."},
			{3197120, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_121_m", "I'm gonna be needing my hammer."},
			{3197121, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_122_m", "Nonsense, lad. I wouldn't have given it to you if you didn't deserve it."},
			{3197122, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_123_m", "Oh, it's good to feel the heft of a hammer again."},
			{3197123, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_124_m", "Come jumping, we've got work to do!"},
			{3197124, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_125_m", "You"},
			{3197125, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_126_m", "Mother has connected the Chamber of Heart to all known Titan facilities on Azeroth."},
			{3197126, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_127_m", "First things first, let's make sure they're all working as intended."},
			{3197127, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_128_m", "Given how much corruption it used to have, I'd say that's good news!"},
			{3197129, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_129_m", "Inactive! What happened to it?"},
			{3168022, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_12_m", "Wait! See those statues? The Amathite must have reactivated the Forge's defenses!"},
			{3197131, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_130_m", "This is not good."},
			{3197347, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_131_m", "And you and spies couldn't find the Zoth. Have you had any luck yourself?"},
			{3197351, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_132_m", "Whatever it is, we've got to get Azeroth's Titan-made defenses ready. Then you and our champion need to find us a target to point them at."},
			{3197376, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_133_m", "Champions! N'zoth is bridging dimensions to assault the Chamber of Heart!"},
			{3197377, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_134_m", "We have to defeat him before he corrupts the soul of Azeroth!"},
			{3197380, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_135_m", "Champions, we're charging the Forge. He's getting weaker. Keep fighting!"},
			{3197381, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_136_m", "The Forge is nearly charged, Champions! Hang in there!"},
			{3197397, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_137_m", "We have full power! Fire!"},
			{3197399, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_138_m", "What do you mean, unstable? Do something!"},
			{3197465, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_139_m", "Mother, can you tell us how to focus the Forge's energies against N'zoth?"},
			{3168023, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_13_m", "We'll have to turn them off before we can cross. The controls should be down below."},
			{3197469, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_140_m", "Ah, I didn't know you have up your sleeve, lad, but all right. Let's fire it up!"},
			{3198093, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_141_m", "No! You've got to keep fighting, champion!"},
			{3198095, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_142_m", "Don't listen to his lies! You don't belong to him!"},
			{3198096, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_143_m", "You're a child of Azeroth!"},
			{3198097, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_144_m", "Her strength is your strength!"},
			{3198099, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_145_m", "Well then, what are you waiting for?!"},
			{3198101, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_146_m", "HOLD ON CHAMPION!"},
			{3198130, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_147_m", "Champions! We're overrun! We cannae fire!"},
			{3198132, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_148_m", "Mother opened a gateway to the chamber. Champions, Azeroth needs your aid."},
			{3198133, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_149_m", "You've done it, Champions! Take the fight to N'zoth!"},
			{3168024, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_14_m", "That's all of them! Onward now!"},
			{3200872, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_150_m", "You"},
			{3206349, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_151_m", "I suppose he's annoyed we interrupted his work."},
			{3206352, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_152_m", "Anomaly? What do you mean?"},
			{3206353, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_153_m", "This cannae be good. I'll meet you back in Uldum."},
			{3206354, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_154_m", "Hmm, nothing unusual out here."},
			{3206355, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_155_m", "Look out! The ceiling's caving in!"},
			{3206356, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_156_m", "The entrance is blocked! Mother, get our champion out of here!"},
			{3206357, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_157_m", "Well then, bring them to me! Hero, I'll meet you outside!"},
			{3206358, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_158_m", "Look! Across the sand! That must be the anomaly!"},
			{3206359, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_159_m", "Wait! Do you feel that? Something's wrong."},
			{3168028, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_15_m", "Oh, that doesn't sound good!"},
			{3206360, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_160_m", "BE CAREFUL, HERO!"},
			{3206361, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_161_m", "You"},
			{3206362, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_162_m", "A nominal amount! Lad, have you lost your mind! We'll be doing the Zoth's work for him!"},
			{3207730, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_163_m", "N'zoth tried to turn the Forge of Origination against us, to reshape the world into his Black Empire. But we'll use it to end them, once and for all."},
			{3207731, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_164_m", "Mother and I will stay here in the chamber and do what we can to guide you. Good luck!"},
			{3208035, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_165_m", "Come on, let's check inside!"},
			{3208074, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_166_m", "You"},
			{3208079, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_167_m", "That was too close for comfort. Let's go, champion."},
			{3208082, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_168_m", "You"},
			{3208085, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_169_m", "Was that N'Zoth's doing? I've never seen anything like it!"},
			{3168029, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_16_m", "The Amafit can make their own watchers! We'll have to worry about that later."},
			{3208383, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_170_m", "We're going to lose the chamber! There's no way to stop him!"},
			{3208384, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_171_m", "You"},
			{3208393, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_172_m", "Hero, can you hear me?"},
			{3208394, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_173_m", "We can't even lose, you hero!"},
			{3208395, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_174_m", "Are you there? Don't you dare give up now!"},
			{3229568, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_175_m", "You"},
			{3168030, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_17_m", "Come on, let's take the lift up to the control chamber."},
			{3168031, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_18_m", "What the? The power's been shut off! Hang on! I'll get his access to the conduits!"},
			{3168032, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_19_m", "This way, champion!"},
			{3168033, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_20_m", "Luke, some of the consoles here are still active!"},
			{3168034, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_21_m", "If we can figure out which one controls the lift, we can reroute power to it and get it working again."},
			{3168035, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_22_m", "Ah, this is the lift's console. If we reroute the power here, we can get her running."},
			{3168036, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_23_m", "This must be where they're powering the defenses we encountered earlier. We can shut this one off."},
			{3168037, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_24_m", "Re-origination! Back away slowly now, best not to be messing with that!"},
			{3168038, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_25_m", "Norgonon Data Archive! Must be where all of the Forge's diagnostics are stored!"},
			{3168040, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_26_m", "That should do it!"},
			{3168041, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_27_m", "Ah! Why do they have to make this contraption so... convoluted?!"},
			{3168043, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_28_m", "Mother, we're not having any luck rerouting the power. Can you have a go from your end?"},
			{3168057, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_29_m", "Chumpey! Are you there? I thought we lost you for a second."},
			{3168058, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_30_m", "If N'zoth's minions are inside the Forge, then this is worse than we thought."},
			{3168060, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_31_m", "We have to, Huddy. Come on!"},
			{3168062, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_32_m", "Looks like the lift is working. The control chamber should be on the third floor."},
			{3168063, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_33_m", "Here we are. I'll contact the Chamber of Heart."},
			{3168064, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_34_m", "We took care of them, but not before N'zoth gave the forge a beating."},
			{3168066, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_35_m", "I'll return to the chamber and start figuring out our next move."},
			{3168067, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_36_m", "We can't afford to lose the Forge again! Do whatever it takes to protect it!"},
			{3168079, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_37_m", "CHAMPION! MOTHER MAY HAVE FOUND A WAY TO RESTORE THE FORGE OF ORIGINATION!"},
			{3168080, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_38_m", "Meet us at the Chamber of Heart as soon as you can!"},
			{3168081, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_39_m", "You're back! Let's hear what mother has to say!"},
			{3168084, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_40_m", "All of the other forges are working full-time to protect Azeroth! Is there anywhere else we can get that power?"},
			{3168085, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_41_m", "That's it then! Looks like we're heading to Pandaria!"},
			{3184799, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_42_m", "I'll meet you at the entrance to the vaults, champion."},
			{3184801, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_43_m", "Careful hero, one of these mogu is still kicking!"},
			{3184803, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_44_m", "You what? Well, that's peculiar."},
			{3184808, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_45_m", "Ugh, what are we gonna do now?"},
			{3184810, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_46_m", "Hmm, if this Mogu's clan is anything like him, maybe they'd be willing to help us."},
			{3184811, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_47_m", "I don't even know the first thing about Mogu Clan Sigils, but I bet Lorewalker showed us. I'll meet you at the Sea to Knowledge!"},
			{3184829, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_48_m", "I'll stay with the Lorewalker and ask what he knows about the vaults. Good luck with the Mogu!"},
			{3184830, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_49_m", "You found the Rajani! Excellent!"},
			{3184831, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_50_m", "Let's just hope they'll put down their spears long enough to hear us out!"},
			{3184833, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_51_m", "Is that how you address the speaker of Azeroth?"},
			{3184836, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_52_m", "It cannae be coincidence that just when we need help with the Forge of Origination, we find a keeper who installed it."},
			{3184837, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_53_m", "You go on ahead. I'll try and talk some sense into him."},
			{3184838, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_54_m", "So, all of the Titan facilities on Pandaria are connected! Fascinating!"},
			{3184839, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_55_m", "Well, no sense standing around while the world is ending, to Mogashan Palace!"},
			{3184840, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_56_m", "Raden said that the secret passage is hidden beneath the palace. We need to find a way down there."},
			{3184841, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_57_m", "Huh! The statues are coming to life!"},
			{3184842, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_58_m", "Looks like defeating the guards opened the door. Let's go, champion."},
			{3184843, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_59_m", "Careful where you step! The moku are known to lead traps for unwary intruders!"},
			{3184844, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_60_m", "That switch must open the way forward, just watch your step around those tiles."},
			{3184845, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_61_m", "A head and staircase!"},
			{3184846, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_62_m", "It looks like this leads underground. Let's find that passage!"},
			{3184847, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_63_m", "Hmm, I didn't see a way to open the door."},
			{3184848, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_64_m", "There must be a switch somewhere. We best start searching."},
			{3184849, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_65_m", "Ah, seems we'll need something to weigh down this tile to keep the door open."},
			{3184850, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_66_m", "The statue? Of course! You've got a sharp mind, hero!"},
			{3184851, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_67_m", "I did it! Now, let's see where this passage leads."},
			{3184852, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_68_m", "Maybe we should have brought a torch!"},
			{3184853, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_69_m", "It's been a while since I've had to walk for this long."},
			{3184854, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_70_m", "Wait! I think we're here! Now, let's find the engine!"},
			{3184855, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_71_m", "What in the name of Azeroth is going on in here?!"},
			{3184856, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_72_m", "I should have known the Mantid would throw their lot in with N'zoth."},
			{3184857, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_73_m", "They're trying to corrupt the vaults! We cannae let that happen!"},
			{3184860, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_74_m", "Champion! How are you still with me?"},
			{3184861, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_75_m", "I'm starting to worry about you, but right now we have to focus on the engine! Come on!"},
			{3184862, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_76_m", "Look at the size of that thing! Go for the eye!"},
			{3184864, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_77_m", "Aye! It means we can use the Forge against N'zoth without re-originating the entire world!"},
			{3184872, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_78_m", "Aye, we only found this place because Azeroth herself showed us the way!"},
			{3184873, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_79_m", "Aye, but we can save the tour for later. We've got a world to save."},
			{3194129, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_80_m", "You're back! What happened?"},
			{3194133, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_81_m", "Aye, you'll have to clear out any beasties so that the anchor can be placed!"},
			{3194134, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_82_m", "Once you have them all set, we'll take the fight to N'zoth!"},
			{3194135, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_83_m", "Caution! We don't do caution."},
			{3194136, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_84_m", "Storm that temple and send those cultists screaming to their bests!"},
			{3194141, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_85_m", "Well done, champions!"},
			{3194142, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_86_m", "Each anchor brings us closer to unleashing the power of the Forge against N'zoth."},
			{3194143, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_87_m", "Good. The sooner you place these anchors, the sooner we bring down N'zoth."},
			{3194144, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_88_m", "Raden, it cannae be. You're a servant of the titans of Azeroth herself!"},
			{3194147, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_89_m", "Raden was a keeper of Azeroth, a great hero, but he lost hope."},
			{3194148, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_90_m", "N'zoth twisted his despair and that corruption festered within him."},
			{3194149, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_91_m", "Take a lesson from this, champions. Do not let N'zoth wield your fears against you."},
			{3194150, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_92_m", "Well, Aperture is certainly the polite way to put it."},
			{3194151, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_93_m", "Good work, champions! The world is better off without Elgan North and his maddening whispers!"},
			{3194152, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_94_m", "Though, take heed, his prophecies were meant to drive his victims insane. Now that he's gone, just put them out of your mind for good."},
			{3194153, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_95_m", "What Mother means is, we only get one shot at this. The closer you get to N'Zoth, the better our odds of hitting him."},
			{3194156, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_96_m", "You've cracked these shell champions! Now for the hard part!"},
			{3194157, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_97_m", "You'll need to enter N'Zoth's mind and weaken him before we can focus the Origination Beam."},
			{3194158, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_98_m", "Guard yourselves. There's no telling what foul beasties are brewing in the Zoth's brain."},
			{3196397, "line", "vo_835_magni_bronzebeard_99_m", "That voice! Where's it coming from?"},
			{3149918, "line", "vo_83_magni_bronzebeard_01_m", "Since being wounded by the mad titan, Azeroth has been crying out in pain. In her hour of need, she lent you her power."},
			{3149919, "line", "vo_83_magni_bronzebeard_02_m", "Today, at long last, she's free from the grasp of the old gods. Her song rings clear and strong throughout this chamber."},
			{3149920, "line", "vo_83_magni_bronzebeard_03_m", "Hold her heart with pride. Know that you are more than a champion of your people. You are a champion of Azeroth!"},
		},
		sound = {
			{568743, "ability", "earthshield_impact_base"},
			{1100333, "ability", "spell_sh_earthshock_cast_44_01"},
			{1100334, "ability", "spell_sh_earthshock_cast_44_02"},
			{1100335, "ability", "spell_sh_earthshock_cast_44_03"},
			{1100336, "ability", "spell_sh_earthshock_cast_44_04"},
			{1375484, "ability", "spell_sh_earthshock_revamp_cast01"},
			{1375485, "ability", "spell_sh_earthshock_revamp_cast02"},
			{1375486, "ability", "spell_sh_earthshock_revamp_cast03"},
			{1375487, "ability", "spell_sh_earthshock_revamp_cast04"},
			{1375488, "ability", "spell_sh_earthshock_revamp_cast05"},
			{2576266, "ability", "spell_sh_revamp_earthshock_cast_01"},
			{2576271, "ability", "spell_sh_revamp_earthshock_cast_02"},
			{2576274, "ability", "spell_sh_revamp_earthshock_cast_03"},
			{2576255, "ability", "spell_sh_revamp_earthshock_impact01"},
			{2576256, "ability", "spell_sh_revamp_earthshock_impact02"},
			{2576257, "ability", "spell_sh_revamp_earthshock_impact03"},
		},
	},
	[3] = {
		voice = {
			{562979, "pick", "tyrandewhisperwindgreeting01", "Ishmaelah, may a loon light your path."},
			{562966, "pick", "tyrandewhisperwindgreeting02", "The goddess is my shield."},
			{562974, "pick", "tyrandewhisperwindgreeting03", "Elune give me strength."},
			{562969, "pick", "tyrandewhisperwindgreeting05", "I heed the voice of Elune."},
			{562973, "pick", "tyrandewhisperwindgreeting04", "My heart sleeps in the emerald dream."},
			{562968, "pick", "cav_tyrande_rally01", "This is our final stand. Make every blow count!"},
			{562971, "pick", "cav_tyrande_rally03", "Give every ounce of strength, do not despair!"},
			{5327758, "pick", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_27_f", "I know we have the strength to face anything."},
			{5351438, "pick", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_63_f", "Elune Adore"},
			{668081, "greet", "vo_5.1_alp_tyrande_greet_01", "WE ARE WASTING TIME!"},
			{668083, "greet", "vo_5.1_alp_tyrande_greet_02", "We've got them cornered!"},
			{668085, "greet", "vo_5.1_alp_tyrande_greet_03", "They defile everything they touch."},
			{668087, "greet", "vo_5.1_alp_tyrande_greet_04", "What are we waiting for?"},
			{562978, "aggro", "tyrandewhisperwindaggro01", "Anudora!"},
			{562977, "aggro", "tyrandewhisperwindaggro02", "Book Hallam'dor!"},
			{562980, "aggro", "tyrandewhisperwindaggro03", "In newly referred."},
			{573182, "aggro", "vo_et_echooftyrande_aggro_01", "Let the peaceful light of Elune soothe your souls in this dark time."},
			{562972, "alert", "cav_tyrande_wispintro01", "The trap is sprung, the horn has sounded. Archimonde will meet his end this day. Rejoice!"},
			{897376, "alert", "vo_54_or_tyrande_intro_1", "ANU DORA!"},
			{897378, "alert", "vo_54_or_tyrande_intro_2", "Are they my sisters? For column door!"},
			{897380, "alert", "vo_54_or_tyrande_intro_3", "Don't think we're here to save you, troll. We're here for Kalimdor. Get forces inside the gates while we distract the enemy."},
			{573192, "alert", "vo_et_echooftyrande_intro_01", "There is nothing left for you here, nothing but death and sorrow."},
			{573194, "alert", "vo_et_echooftyrande_intro_02", "The darkness surrounds you, the light of a loon is your only salvation."},
			{573196, "alert", "vo_et_echooftyrande_intro_03", "The moonlight can bring rest to your weary souls in this forgotten place."},
			{573198, "alert", "vo_et_echooftyrande_intro_04", "Give yourselves to the night, Elune will guide you from this mortal prison."},
			{573200, "alert", "vo_et_echooftyrande_intro_05", "You have chosen a path of darkness. Mother Moon, guide my hand. Allow me to bring rest to these misbegotten souls. You have chosen a path of darkness."},
			{4640874, "line", "vo_100_tyrande_whisperwind_01_f", "This seed is everything. So many beloved souls, entrusting their fate, their hopes to us."},
			{4678292, "line", "vo_100_tyrande_whisperwind_02_f", "Sleep, my love, until the forest calls once more."},
			{4678941, "line", "vo_100_tyrande_whisperwind_03_f", "He would want to be here with me. The Shadowlands become ever more difficult to reach, and yet there he remains."},
			{4678944, "line", "vo_100_tyrande_whisperwind_04_f", "We have lost so much Ysera, and still I am asked to sacrifice."},
			{4678950, "line", "vo_100_tyrande_whisperwind_05_f", "But when, when will my people see their home restored? When will we know peace like we did before?"},
			{4679015, "line", "vo_100_tyrande_whisperwind_06_f", "I trust you, my dear friend, and I long to see it with my own eyes."},
			{4680207, "line", "vo_100_tyrande_whisperwind_07_f", "Hey, Sarah, your flight needs you."},
			{4680208, "line", "vo_100_tyrande_whisperwind_08_f", "We need you."},
			{4680209, "line", "vo_100_tyrande_whisperwind_09_f", "Whatever the price may be for your return to Azeroth, name it!"},
			{4680211, "line", "vo_100_tyrande_whisperwind_10_f", "Tell us."},
			{4680214, "line", "vo_100_tyrande_whisperwind_11_f", "What?"},
			{4680216, "line", "vo_100_tyrande_whisperwind_12_f", "No!"},
			{4680217, "line", "vo_100_tyrande_whisperwind_13_f", "We will find another way."},
			{4680220, "line", "vo_100_tyrande_whisperwind_14_f", "Then, then I will stay as well."},
			{4680221, "line", "vo_100_tyrande_whisperwind_15_f", "Shandris and the others can..."},
			{4680224, "line", "vo_100_tyrande_whisperwind_16_f", "I am so tired, Malfurion."},
			{4680225, "line", "vo_100_tyrande_whisperwind_17_f", "Do not ask this of me."},
			{4680226, "line", "vo_100_tyrande_whisperwind_18_f", "after everything we have endured."},
			{4680230, "line", "vo_100_tyrande_whisperwind_19_f", "Until I see you again."},
			{4680231, "line", "vo_100_tyrande_whisperwind_20_f", "I will dream of the night we may truly rest. Together."},
			{5482431, "line", "vo_1025_tyrande_whisperwind_01_f", "This village welcomes all who wish to dwell here."},
			{5482432, "line", "vo_1025_tyrande_whisperwind_02_f", "Heijl, Val'sharah, Ashenmael."},
			{5482433, "line", "vo_1025_tyrande_whisperwind_03_f", "And one day, when life blossoms again upon its ashen shores,"},
			{5482438, "line", "vo_1025_tyrande_whisperwind_04_f", "You"},
			{5482442, "line", "vo_1025_tyrande_whisperwind_05_f", "Though we will never forget the past, it is time to look forward."},
			{5482444, "line", "vo_1025_tyrande_whisperwind_06_f", "No, my beloved daughter, I think we will tarry here in Belenath the while."},
			{5482445, "line", "vo_1025_tyrande_whisperwind_07_f", "I believe we have earned some time alone together."},
			{5482448, "line", "vo_1025_tyrande_whisperwind_08_f", "They have all they need in you, child."},
			{5482452, "line", "vo_1025_tyrande_whisperwind_09_f", "Now come, I want to show you a spot that would be perfect for our home."},
			{5517199, "line", "vo_1025_tyrande_whisperwind_10_f", "But it shall not be our only home."},
			{5517200, "line", "vo_1025_tyrande_whisperwind_11_f", "These are sacred places to us."},
			{5517201, "line", "vo_1025_tyrande_whisperwind_12_f", "We shall protect them forevermore."},
			{5517202, "line", "vo_1025_tyrande_whisperwind_13_f", "We will return to Teldrassil, and build a new..."},
			{5517204, "line", "vo_1025_tyrande_whisperwind_14_f", "Ahh!"},
			{5517205, "line", "vo_1025_tyrande_whisperwind_15_f", "Hahaha"},
			{5517206, "line", "vo_1025_tyrande_whisperwind_16_f", "Whew!"},
			{5517207, "line", "vo_1025_tyrande_whisperwind_17_f", "I'm sorry, but I'm sorry."},
			{5320189, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_01_f", "Firok's primalists are terrorizing the local wildlife. Show them the error of their ways."},
			{5320192, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_02_f", "Well done, Champion. This area is safe. For now."},
			{5320709, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_03_f", "The druids of the flame must not be allowed to claim more ground."},
			{5320712, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_04_f", "Well struck, in time they will come to fear the will of nature."},
			{5320940, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_05_f", "The druids of the flames seek to bolster their ranks in the dream. Strike them down and seal their portals."},
			{5320961, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_06_f", "If the enemies of the dream make new portals, they will again be met by the edge of our blades. Well done."},
			{5320993, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_07_f", "Why has Varok focused his attack here?"},
			{5320996, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_08_f", "Farok's trail of destruction makes it all the easier to follow him."},
			{5321005, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_09_f", "The dream is besieged by flame, how is this possible?"},
			{5321009, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_10_f", "You"},
			{5321010, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_11_f", "Smoldorron dares to claim this realm as his own? We will stop him."},
			{5321019, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_12_f", "He was twisted beyond redemption, but we will mourn him still. Thankfully the seed of life remains unharmed."},
			{5321020, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_13_f", "Take care, champions. The seed of life is volatile in mortal hands."},
			{5321021, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_14_f", "You will need to work together and quickly to safely transport it through Maritha's portal."},
			{5321022, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_15_f", "With the power of this seed, a Myrdracil will be defended. Farok will not succeed."},
			{5321043, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_16_f", "Yet a meirdressil is still in danger. The next seed resides where the firelands invade the dream."},
			{5321044, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_17_f", "The seeds of life are in place. A mere drasil awaits our defence. And virak, my wrath."},
			{5327745, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_18_f", "Do you ever think back to the time before the sundering Alexstrasza, when the world was whole?"},
			{5327747, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_19_f", "But we faltered from within. The world itself was rent asunder."},
			{5327749, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_20_f", "through thousands of years and unspeakable tragedies."},
			{5327750, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_21_f", "The Well of Eternity. The Legion at Nordrassil."},
			{5327752, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_22_f", "Yet this precious tree, a meadrasil, has brought us together."},
			{5327753, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_23_f", "and when I look upon the faces of those who have risen to its aid both old and new"},
			{5327754, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_24_f", "I see something returning that we had lost."},
			{5327756, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_25_f", "Unity."},
			{5327757, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_26_f", "though there is much work to be done."},
			{5327759, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_28_f", "if we face it together."},
			{5328297, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_29_f", "We have not the strength to face Verac alone."},
			{5328300, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_30_f", "and our allies are unable to enter the dream."},
			{5328309, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_31_f", "Victory is a fleeting hope. We will not be able to hold Farak's attention for long without reinforcements."},
			{5328336, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_32_f", "You"},
			{5328443, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_33_f", "Azeroth has answered us. A mergesal shall not fall."},
			{5328455, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_34_f", "Then the time has come to extinguish his flame."},
			{5328852, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_35_f", "These lies poison my people against me."},
			{5328856, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_36_f", "Traitors, apostates! This madness ends here!"},
			{5340723, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_37_f", "Norana! You've set an entire barrow ablaze! What madness is this?"},
			{5340729, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_38_f", "Our people have seen enough forests burn, Narana. Whatever these fanatics promised you, it is not worth the toll the firelands would exact!"},
			{5340735, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_39_f", "Wait! Narana! I-"},
			{5340738, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_40_f", "I knew Norama once, Champion. I hesitated. It will not happen again."},
			{5340741, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_41_f", "Join me on the surface and we will attempt to track her down."},
			{5340999, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_42_f", "Something blocks their path."},
			{5341451, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_43_f", "He burns for retribution. Firok will stop at nothing to kill you himself."},
			{5341461, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_44_f", "But not for Ashen, dear. The Prophet of the Flame must be the one behind it all."},
			{5342781, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_45_f", "and the druids of the flame have opened the way for them all. I must know why they are here."},
			{5343814, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_46_f", "Of course."},
			{5343815, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_47_f", "I cradled it as I would a child."},
			{5343816, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_48_f", "and promised the souls within."},
			{5351424, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_49_f", "Children of the Stars"},
			{5351425, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_50_f", "It has been a long journey to this moment."},
			{5351426, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_51_f", "Our people have fought, suffered, and sacrificed so much."},
			{5351427, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_52_f", "And yet here, in the shade of Amirdrasil's young boughs,"},
			{5351428, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_53_f", "We may at last begin to heal."},
			{5351429, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_54_f", "Unto the souls who now watch over this sacred place."},
			{5351430, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_55_f", "We offer our blessings."},
			{5351431, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_56_f", "Symbols of dedication, strength and love."},
			{5351432, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_57_f", "Unto this moonwell, we author this precious vial."},
			{5351433, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_58_f", "The last water saved from the temple of Donasus."},
			{5351434, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_59_f", "May they bathe, Amirdrasil, in Elune's radiance."},
			{5351435, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_60_f", "and bestow her blessings upon this place."},
			{5351436, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_61_f", "Bell Armeath, the Arms of the Goddess."},
			{5351437, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_62_f", "In her embrace, may the Kaldorei finally know peace."},
			{5353634, "line", "vo_102_tyrande_whisperwind_64_f", "to honor their sacrifice."},
			{668075, "line", "vo_5.1_alp_tyrande_conclude_01", "I would have charged right in. Many more lives would have been lost in my rush for victory."},
			{668077, "line", "vo_5.1_alp_tyrande_conclude_02", "I see that now. Our strength is yours to command, High King. May this be the first of many victories."},
			{668079, "line", "vo_5.1_alp_tyrande_fort_01", "Our fortifications are ready!"},
			{668089, "line", "vo_5.1_alp_tyrande_imp_01", "We are wasting time. We should move in for the kill!"},
			{668091, "line", "vo_5.1_alp_tyrande_imp_02", "You're being tentative, Varian. You must be decisive if you wish to lead the Alliance."},
			{668093, "line", "vo_5.1_alp_tyrande_imp_03", "Ugh, why do we not attack them outright?"},
			{668095, "line", "vo_5.1_alp_tyrande_imp_04", "They mock us from within the temple!"},
			{668097, "line", "vo_5.1_alp_tyrande_opng_01", "We have them cornered inside the temple. We should strike now."},
			{668099, "line", "vo_5.1_alp_tyrande_opng_02", "or the more reason to purify it."},
			{668101, "line", "vo_5.1_alp_tyrande_opng_03", "You are wasting precious time."},
			{1342761, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_01", "We must go deeper into the nightmare. Wherever he is, Peril is already upon him."},
			{1342763, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_02", "His location is still unclear, but he lives."},
			{1342765, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_03", "Such malevolent laughter. Xavius, you cruel creature, I am coming for you!"},
			{1342767, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_04", "Malfurion, he is in pain. Keep fighting my love!"},
			{1342769, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_05", "I see, swirling red mist, gnashing teeth."},
			{1342771, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_06", "Do not let anything disturb my meditation. I must see through the chaos."},
			{1342773, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_07", "Asha Allah, to me."},
			{1342775, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_08", "Meet me back at the refuge and we will continue our search."},
			{1342777, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_09", "Come, we must make haste."},
			{1342779, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_10", "Elothir, by Elune, not you, too. Have you seen my husband?"},
			{1342781, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_11", "The corruption is thick here. What is that across the bridge? Beyond God."},
			{1342783, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_12", "Feathers and blood. It is still wet. There may still be time."},
			{1342785, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_13", "The path splits. Wait. Do you see that?"},
			{1342787, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_14", "I will go to him. Elothir?"},
			{1342789, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_15", "Hold yourself on the edge of madness, Elothir. Mother Moon will carry you as long as she can."},
			{1342791, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_16", "I will petition Elune. The Nightmare Stane cannot be removed, but perhaps we can hold it back."},
			{1342793, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_17", "You must help me find him. Is there anything I can do?"},
			{1342825, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_18", "I WILL NOT LOSE YOU!"},
			{1342827, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_19", "You take care of that foul-mouthed satyr. I am going to my husband."},
			{1342829, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_20", "By a loon, your foulness will be purged from this place!"},
			{1342831, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_21", "No! Not without you!"},
			{1342833, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_22", "Malfurion, call out to me!"},
			{1342835, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_23", "These hoofprints follow the path to the left. Come quickly."},
			{1342837, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_24", "Champion to me! I have found something!"},
			{1342839, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_25", "Where are you, Malfurion? Answer me!"},
			{1342841, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_26", "I cannot tell where his voice is coming from. Quickly, search the buildings to the west. I will scour the east for signs of him."},
			{1342843, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_27", "Speak to me when you are ready to leave."},
			{1342845, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_28", "Shalaneer is just ahead. Be ready for whatever foulness awaits us."},
			{1342847, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_29", "Hello Theorists, beyond our reach now."},
			{1342863, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_30", "Now Xavius has me by the throat. I must abandon my beloved and subdue the most beautiful creature I have ever known."},
			{1342865, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_31", "When Malfurion returned to my side, we worked as one, as if he had never been away. Have you ever loved as I have?"},
			{1342867, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_32", "even in slumber his presence calmed me. I left my fears below the earth and emerged, ready to lead my people."},
			{1342869, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_33", "Whenever I was plagued with doubt, I would descend into his barrow. I watched over him as he slept."},
			{1342871, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_34", "Ah, Malfurion, my beloved, for a hundred, hundred years he slept beneath moonglade."},
			{1342873, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_35", "Xavius is using Malfurion to bait me, to distract me from what must be done. We are the only ones who can stop Ysera."},
			{1342875, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_36", "Come with me. Yacerra won't stop until this whole realm is plunged into the nightmare."},
			{1342877, "line", "vo_701_tyrande_whisperwind_37", "Ysera? NO!"},
			{1378915, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_01", "Stay close, do not let the nightmare confound you."},
			{1378917, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_02", "the corruption is thick here. What is that across the bridge? Follow closely."},
			{1378919, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_03", "The path splits. Wait, what is that?"},
			{1378921, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_04", "Do not let anything disturb my meditation."},
			{1378923, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_05", "Meet me back at the refuge and we will continue our search. Be quick about it."},
			{1378927, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_06", "I will need to focus on the vision to understand its message. We have had our differences in the past, but this is bigger than both of us. Can I trust you?"},
			{1378929, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_07", "These hoofprints follow the path to the left, after them, quickly!"},
			{1378931, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_08", "Return to me, Warrior of the Horde! I have found something!"},
			{1378933, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_09", "I cannot tell where his voice is coming from. Search the buildings to the west. Now I will scour the east for signs of him."},
			{1378935, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_10", "Shalaneer is just ahead. You should be ready for whatever foulness awaits us."},
			{1378939, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_11", "There is no time to mourn. Elothir is beyond my reach now. Come and do not delay."},
			{1388085, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_12", "Warrior of the Horde, to me, I have found something!"},
			{1396608, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_13", "Today we celebrate a great triumph, one paid for with the blood of those most dear to us."},
			{1396610, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_14", "You"},
			{1396612, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_15", "Though I am often at odds with your horde, I cannot question the courage you've shown, saving Valshara."},
			{1396614, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_16", "You"},
			{1401234, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_17", "I have no time for games."},
			{1401235, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_18", "I cannot tell where his voice is coming from. Quickly, search the buildings to the east. I will scour the west for signs of him."},
			{1401236, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_19", "I cannot tell where his voice is coming from. Search the buildings to the east. I will scour the west for signs of him."},
			{1401237, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_20", "Where are you, Malfurion? Answer me!"},
			{1401241, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_21", "Elune, curse you, Xavius! You will pay for this charade. I swear it!"},
			{1401243, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_22", "When will this nightmare end?"},
			{1401245, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_23", "Hold on, my love! I am near."},
			{1401247, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_24", "Yes! I hear you! I am close now!"},
			{1401248, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_25", "To me, champion, our chase is done."},
			{1401249, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_26", "Come to me, warrior of the Horde. Our chase is finished."},
			{1411406, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_27", "Malfurion, where is my beloved?"},
			{1444333, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_28_f", "Now the tears of Elune are added to our arsenal. May they bring us victory against the Legion!"},
			{1444335, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_29_f", "Thanks to your courage, the ancient lands of Balchara cannot long last begin to heal."},
			{1488842, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_30_f", "By the light of Elune, we will end this madness!"},
			{1488843, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_31_f", "Are you truly lost, Jisera? After all we have built, all we have done..."},
			{1488844, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_32_f", "I will end your torment, Dreamer. And I promise, we will avenge you!"},
			{1488845, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_33_f", "Not while I still draw breath."},
			{1488846, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_34_f", "Koda, keep her distracted. Lianus, mend our wounds. Champion with me."},
			{1488847, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_35_f", "Shh, shh. It is over now, Ysera."},
			{1488848, "line", "vo_703_tyrande_whisperwind_36_f", "Sleep now, dear Ysera. Sleep forever, and dream no more.\""},
			{1523527, "line", "vo_71_tyrande_whisperwind_01_f", "Kaldorei, prepare to charge the concourse. Elune calls you to rid the city of evil."},
			{1523541, "line", "vo_71_tyrande_whisperwind_02_f", "Time is short. Champion, mount and ride with us to the concourse before the Nightborne can reinforce their position."},
			{1523543, "line", "vo_71_tyrande_whisperwind_03_f", "So the time has come to march an army upon the city of my birth. May Elune grant us a quick end to this conflict."},
			{1524042, "line", "vo_71_tyrande_whisperwind_04_f", "We must spread word of the Alliance's arrival. Post notice throughout the city that the reign of the Grand Magistrix will soon be ended. Inspire the Shaldorei to resist."},
			{1524044, "line", "vo_71_tyrande_whisperwind_05_f", "The more shaldorei that take up the fight, the fewer of my people who will be lost in the liberation of Suramar."},
			{1524059, "line", "vo_71_tyrande_whisperwind_06_f", "The once proud Shaldorei attack their own people. This situation is even more desperate than I imagined."},
			{1524060, "line", "vo_71_tyrande_whisperwind_07_f", "Ellison's forces are waylaying refugees, fleeing Suramar through the Crimson Thicket, a perfect opportunity to test their skills in battle."},
			{1524415, "line", "vo_71_tyrande_whisperwind_08_f", "Our supplies are running low, but the enemy has plenty to spare. Ride into Suramar and liberate supplies from the forces of the magistrix."},
			{1524417, "line", "vo_71_tyrande_whisperwind_09_f", "Morale has been reinvigorated by the arrival of fresh supplies. You have done well."},
			{1524455, "line", "vo_71_tyrande_whisperwind_10_f", "I... I am well. What has happened?"},
			{1524582, "line", "vo_71_tyrande_whisperwind_11_f", "Arcanist Thalyssra, I remember where your order stood in the War of the Ancients. How do we know you won't betray us and become the next Elisande, the next Azshara?"},
			{1524584, "line", "vo_71_tyrande_whisperwind_12_f", "The Kaldorei will fight to see the Legion defeated and the Nightwell destroyed. Beyond that, we shall see where Elune's wisdom guides us."},
			{1724262, "line", "vo_732_tyrande_whisperwind_01_f", "In my lifetime, I have twice witnessed a sundering of the world. Mother Moon, I pray I do not see a third."},
			{1724263, "line", "vo_732_tyrande_whisperwind_02_f", "I sense a sorcerer's touch upon this crystal."},
			{1724264, "line", "vo_732_tyrande_whisperwind_03_f", "contrite words. Yet I must wonder whether he truly meant them."},
			{1724265, "line", "vo_732_tyrande_whisperwind_04_f", "After Illidan faced defeat atop the Black Temple, I tried to let go of my feelings, my distrust and bitterness."},
			{1724266, "line", "vo_732_tyrande_whisperwind_05_f", "When I learned that he was alive, leading the fight against the Legion on the broken shore, I could not bring myself to speak to him."},
			{1724267, "line", "vo_732_tyrande_whisperwind_06_f", "The time for talk has passed. Seems he has a duty to fulfill, as do we. Let us be about it, champion."},
			{1800625, "line", "vo_735_tyrande_whisperwind_01_f", "Arcanist Thalyssra, I remember where your order stood in the War of the Ancients. How do we know you won't betray us and become the next Elisande, the next Azshara?"},
			{1800628, "line", "vo_735_tyrande_whisperwind_02_f", "The Kaldorei will fight to see the Legion defeated, and the Nightwell destroyed. Beyond that, we shall see where Elune's wisdom guides us."},
			{2108808, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_01_f", "Malfurion, NO!"},
			{2108809, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_02_f", "You did not kill him, Orc. Why?"},
			{2108810, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_03_f", "This entire war is without honor! How dare you spill so much innocent blood for nothing!"},
			{2108811, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_04_f", "Because you spared Malfurion, I will offer you a choice."},
			{2111304, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_05_f", "You"},
			{2111305, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_06_f", "You"},
			{2111306, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_07_f", "You"},
			{2111307, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_08_f", "You"},
			{2111308, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_09_f", "You"},
			{2111474, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_10_f", "Do not lose faith."},
			{2468398, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_10_f_nightwarrior", "Do not lose faith."},
			{2111475, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_11_f", "Elune, light your way!"},
			{2468401, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_11_f_nightwarrior", "Elune, light your way."},
			{2111476, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_12_f", "heed the voice of Elune."},
			{2468402, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_12_f_nightwarrior", "heed the voice of Elune."},
			{2111477, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_13_f", "We will fight to protect our future."},
			{2468403, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_13_f_nightwarrior", "We will fight to protect our future."},
			{2111478, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_14_f", "There is a time for patience and a time for action."},
			{2468404, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_14_f_nightwarrior", "There is a time for patience and a time for action."},
			{2111479, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_15_f", "The Kaldorei will endure."},
			{2468405, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_15_f_nightwarrior", "The Kaldorei will endure."},
			{2111480, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_16_f", "Our foes will know our fury."},
			{2468407, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_16_f_nightwarrior", "Our foes will know our fury."},
			{2111481, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_17_f", "We must find a way to endure."},
			{2111482, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_18_f", "The Goddess gives me strength."},
			{2468408, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_18_f_nightwarrior", "The Goddess gives me strength."},
			{2111483, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_19_f", "Ishmaelah"},
			{2468409, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_19_f_nightwarrior", "Ishmael Allah."},
			{2111484, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_20_f", "We are the Children of Elune."},
			{2468411, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_20_f_nightwarrior", "We are the Children of Elune."},
			{2111485, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_21_f", "What would you ask of the Kaldorei?"},
			{2468412, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_21_f_nightwarrior", "What would you ask of the Kaldorei?"},
			{2111486, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_22_f", "I speak for my people."},
			{2468413, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_22_f_nightwarrior", "I speak for my people."},
			{2111487, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_23_f", "It is my honor to serve Elune."},
			{2468414, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_23_f_nightwarrior", "It is my honor to serve Elune."},
			{2111488, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_24_f", "In her light, all truths are revealed."},
			{2468420, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_24_f_nightwarrior", "In her light, all truths are revealed."},
			{2111489, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_25_f", "How could those monsters do this?"},
			{2111490, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_26_f", "You"},
			{2111491, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_27_f", "You"},
			{2111492, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_28_f", "You"},
			{2111531, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_29_f", "Attempt to stop me from taking him away and die or remain there kneeling in the dirt and live."},
			{2111532, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_30_f", "This war is lost, Teldrassil will soon fall."},
			{2111533, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_31_f", "King Anduin gave me a hearthstone back to Stormwind. There I will tend my love's wounds and help my people find respite from this madness."},
			{2111534, "line", "vo_801_tyrande_whisperwind_32_f", "Take my Hippogriff to Darnassus, ensure that the Horde's occupation is as tolerable as it can be."},
			{2128661, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_01_f", "Over here."},
			{2128662, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_02_f", "This way!"},
			{2128663, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_03_f", "Watch out!"},
			{2128664, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_04_f", "CHAMPION!"},
			{2128665, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_05_f", "Stand ready!"},
			{2128666, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_06_f", "I like you, say, would you happen to have a twin brother?"},
			{2468421, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_06_f_nightwarrior", "I like you. Say, would you happen to have a twin brother?"},
			{2128667, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_07_f", "No, I am not into blindfolds. Well, perhaps a little."},
			{2468422, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_07_f_nightwarrior", "No, I am not into blindfolds. Well, perhaps a little."},
			{2128668, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_08_f", "My advice? Avoid wells of magical energy. Not only will you become addicted, you will devolve into some flavor of derivative elf."},
			{2468423, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_08_f_nightwarrior", "My advice? Avoid wells of magical energy. Not only will you become addicted, you will devolve into some flavor of derivative elf."},
			{2432402, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_09_f", "until every horde soldier is purged from Darkshore."},
			{2432403, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_10_f", "Well done. Let each horde death be a message to the banshee queen."},
			{2432404, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_11_f", "Murloc infestations continue to plague our lands and harass our people, exterminate them."},
			{2432405, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_12_f", "These foul pests are of blight upon Darkshore. They will not be missed."},
			{2432406, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_13_f", "are taking advantage of the turmoil in Darkshore. Drive them back into the depths where they belong."},
			{2432407, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_14_f", "The naga's advance has been halted. For now, we must remain vigilant."},
			{2432408, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_15_f", "Our ancestral spirits have been driven to madness by the Horde's atrocities. Put them to rest and bring them peace."},
			{2432409, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_16_f", "A necessary measure, if regrettable. Thank you for carrying it out."},
			{2432410, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_17_f", "The remnants of the Twilight's hammer have crawled out of hiding."},
			{2432411, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_18_f", "The cultists are scattered and broken. If they are wise, they will remain that way."},
			{2432412, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_19_f", "This foe poses a grave threat to the people of Darkshore."},
			{2432413, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_20_f", "A powerful adversary has been spotted nearby. Act swiftly, champion!"},
			{2432414, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_21_f", "Our Sentinels have identified a new threat in the area. Slay it before it assaults our forces."},
			{2432415, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_22_f", "The threat is no more. Well thought champion."},
			{2432416, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_23_f", "Another enemy thwarted. Darkshore owes you a debt of gratitude."},
			{2432417, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_24_f", "Your actions have saved countless lives. Thank you."},
			{2432418, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_25_f", "Without our druids to tend to the creatures of Darkshore, corruption has spread unchecked. We must stop it before it is too late."},
			{2432419, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_26_f", "You have done what you can. Let us hope your efforts help restore balance to the land."},
			{2433097, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_27_f", "With ancient words, I invoke your most ruthless phase."},
			{2433098, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_28_f", "With this offering, I demand to wear your darkest face."},
			{2433099, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_29_f", "Elune, make me the instrument of your vengeance!"},
			{2433100, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_30_f", "Now we shall have justice, the night warrior lives within me."},
			{2433151, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_31_f", "Victory is ours this night!"},
			{2433152, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_32_f", "Elune has given us the power to save ourselves."},
			{2433153, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_33_f", "The horde burned our forests, thinking to kill our hope."},
			{2433154, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_34_f", "They died for that folly, for our hope resides not in the trees, but in our bonds to each other."},
			{2433155, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_35_f", "We are Kaldorei!"},
			{2433434, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_36_f", "Elune! Your people loved you, yet you watched, distant and aloof, as they died in torment!"},
			{2433435, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_37_f", "I served you for millennia, but tonight I do not come as a maiden, mother, or even priestess."},
			{2433436, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_38_f", "Now, I will serve you only if you grant me justice!"},
			{2433437, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_39_f", "The Horde shall tremble as our darkness falls."},
			{2433471, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_40_f", "Maiev, Shandris, prepare our forces for war."},
			{2433472, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_41_f", "Champion, with me, Nathanos Blightcaller lurks nearby, with two of the banishy queens valkyr."},
			{2433473, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_42_f", "We will kill them all!"},
			{2433474, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_43_f", "Teldrassil burned because I chose to spare Sarfang's life."},
			{2433475, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_44_f", "Countless innocents were murdered. Entire families erased in moments."},
			{2433477, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_45_f", "The time for mercy is over."},
			{2433478, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_46_f", "Anu Tora!"},
			{2433479, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_47_f", "He is not here."},
			{2433480, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_48_f", "I failed to protect my people, but I will avenge them."},
			{2433481, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_49_f", "Leave him to rot. He does not deserve a clean death."},
			{2433482, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_50_f", "Hold, more come."},
			{2433483, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_51_f", "No. Wait for my signal before you attack."},
			{2433484, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_52_f", "Take, Blightcaller. The Valkyr are mine."},
			{2433485, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_53_f", "Elune's wrath guides my glaive. I can sense them ahead."},
			{2433486, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_54_f", "There he is."},
			{2433487, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_55_f", "You will not see another sunrise, monster!"},
			{2433488, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_56_f", "I am no queen. I am the Kaldorei's vengeance."},
			{2433515, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_57_f", "BLIGHT COLLER!"},
			{2433516, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_58_f", "So be it. I will soak the land with the blood of the horde."},
			{2433517, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_59_f", "I must go for a time. Fight well."},
			{2433518, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_60_f", "You've built a fine foothold at Bashal Aran. Well done!"},
			{2433519, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_61_f", "I can aid you in slaying our enemies. Where would you strike next?"},
			{2433583, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_62_f", "Shaul Karath!"},
			{2433584, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_63_f", "We do not stand the loon. No!"},
			{2433585, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_64_f", "Champion, focus on the valkyr. I will deal with this brute."},
			{2433586, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_65_f", "You must fight the shadow in your heart, sisters!"},
			{2433587, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_66_f", "Never again, our story bus!"},
			{2433588, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_67_f", "No. Our forces gather. We will settle this another day."},
			{2433589, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_68_f", "Blightcaller yet lives, but at the cost of one of his queen's valkyr."},
			{2433590, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_69_f", "The time has come to reclaim our home."},
			{2433591, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_70_f", "We cannot dwell in the past, not with our very future at stake. Lead our people to victory as I sate the Night Warrior's wrath."},
			{2433592, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_71_f", "Shea, Maiev, I must speak to you alone."},
			{2433593, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_72_f", "Hero, we fought but a fraction of the Horde's forces. I will share Dorotha's vision with you, so we may scout them further."},
			{2433594, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_73_f", "You"},
			{2433595, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_74_f", "You"},
			{2433596, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_75_f", "You"},
			{2433597, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_76_f", "Rally our allies. Sharpen your glaives. Dark Shore will be ours once more."},
			{2435291, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_77_f", "My people need action, not excuses. We will not languish in storm wind, while the horde defiles our lands."},
			{2435292, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_78_f", "No, we will reclaim our home now."},
			{2435293, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_79_f", "We shall have vengeance for the slain, and show Sylvanas that she has not won. And if the Alliance will not aid us, we shall do so alone."},
			{2435957, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_80_f", "Ina shul da elun!"},
			{2435958, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_81_f", "Khuleraat shul, Khuleraat sin!"},
			{2435959, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_82_f", "Ashrok, Ilissar, Anodorini, Ashka!"},
			{2472463, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_83_f", "You"},
			{2472464, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_84_f", "You"},
			{2472465, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_85_f", "You"},
			{2472466, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_86_f", "You"},
			{2472467, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_87_f", "You"},
			{2472468, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_88_f", "You"},
			{2472469, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_89_f", "You"},
			{2472470, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_90_f", "You"},
			{2472471, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_91_f", "You"},
			{2472472, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_92_f", "You"},
			{2472473, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_93_f", "You"},
			{2472474, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_94_f", "You"},
			{2472475, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_95_f", "You"},
			{2472476, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_96_f", "You"},
			{2472477, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_97_f", "You"},
			{2472478, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_98_f", "You"},
			{2472479, "line", "vo_81_tyrande_whisperwind_99_f", "You"},
			{3169940, "line", "vo_835_tyrande_whisperwind_01_f", "No, not while the Black Moon still cries out for vengeance, not until the Horde has answered for its treachery."},
			{3169942, "line", "vo_835_tyrande_whisperwind_02_f", "And when the next Warchief musters an army,"},
			{3169944, "line", "vo_835_tyrande_whisperwind_03_f", "Your faith is naive, Lion-son. I will sign no treaty unless it is written in the banshee's blood!"},
			{3178700, "line", "vo_835_tyrande_whisperwind_04_f", "The young king is foolish to trust our enemies."},
			{3178702, "line", "vo_835_tyrande_whisperwind_05_f", "If the wolf is rabbit, it matters not who rides it. Sooner or later, the beast will bear its fangs."},
			{3178704, "line", "vo_835_tyrande_whisperwind_06_f", "Know this. My hunger for vengeance will not be sated so long as Sylvanas Windrunner remains free. And until I know why Elune abandoned her children."},
			{3178706, "line", "vo_835_tyrande_whisperwind_07_f", "I will tarry no longer in this city of men. Let us leave for the boughs of Nodrassil."},
			{3178707, "line", "vo_835_tyrande_whisperwind_08_f", "the Sentinels to every corner of Azeroth."},
			{3669885, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_01_f", "I would pay any price to see the banshee impaled upon my glaive."},
			{3669888, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_02_f", "You dare speak to me of peace after the atrocities your kind inflicted?"},
			{3669954, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_03_f", "Rescue the others! The Banshee is mine to kill!"},
			{3669956, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_04_f", "KOR ILLESAR FERANOL!"},
			{3672029, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_05_f", "Shandris, why have you come?"},
			{3672030, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_06_f", "Foolish child, there is no leaving this place, but you can join me here."},
			{3672031, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_07_f", "FOREVER"},
			{3672032, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_08_f", "No! Not while our people suffer inside Torghast!"},
			{3672033, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_09_f", "I will tear that tower apart and the banshee with it!"},
			{3672034, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_10_f", "None shall stop me."},
			{3672035, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_11_f", "Ashrok-i-lesan!"},
			{3672036, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_12_f", "You will know Elune's wrath!"},
			{3672037, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_13_f", "Vengeance for Teldrassil!"},
			{3672077, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_14_f", "What vile magic is this?"},
			{3672078, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_15_f", "No!"},
			{3672079, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_16_f", "Destroy it! Oblivion would be a kind of fate."},
			{3672080, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_17_f", "Sylvanas will never win, this I vow!"},
			{3672081, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_18_f", "The Banshee will know you're suffering, one hundred fold!"},
			{3672092, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_19_f", "No, my hunt will not cease until every soul is saved, and the banshee has answered for her crimes."},
			{3672093, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_20_f", "If that is true, then I entrust this sacred duty to you, child of Teldrassil. Save the souls of our people!"},
			{3672094, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_21_f", "If that is true, then I entrust this sacred duty to you, champion. Save the souls of my people.\""},
			{3672095, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_22_f", "While I claim vengeance upon the one who put them here."},
			{3672096, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_23_f", "You think this hero of the Horde will aid us? I should strike them down where they stand."},
			{3672097, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_24_f", "So be it, see that this champion of the Horde atones for their people's crimes.\""},
			{3672098, "line", "vo_901_tyrande_whisperwind_25_f", "While I claim vengeance for the Kaldorei."},
			{4080177, "line", "vo_91_tyrande_whisperwind_01_f", "Elune, the Rama Shannal ha'fossi man namal yamurada!"},
			{4080179, "line", "vo_91_tyrande_whisperwind_02_f", "Hanu Torini Ashka!"},
			{4080181, "line", "vo_91_tyrande_whisperwind_03_f", "I'M CHILDREN! I'M CHILDREN!"},
			{4080183, "line", "vo_91_tyrande_whisperwind_04_f", "A broken son! I'm dead!"},
			{4080185, "line", "vo_91_tyrande_whisperwind_05_f", "Thank you, child, but I nearly did. I was so consumed by the fires of vengeance that I was blind to the ashes at our feet."},
			{4080186, "line", "vo_91_tyrande_whisperwind_06_f", "I see now that while many of our people desire retribution, what we need most is renewal."},
			{4080189, "line", "vo_91_tyrande_whisperwind_07_f", "Then I shall endeavor to be worthy of it. Watch over us from the bow, Sastari. Elune Adore."},
			{4092647, "line", "vo_91_tyrande_whisperwind_08_f", "Ever since Darkshore, rage has swelled inside me, a tide under which I seemed destined to drown."},
			{4092648, "line", "vo_91_tyrande_whisperwind_09_f", "It was not until I heard Elune's voice that I recognized the grief buried beneath my anger. Sorrow intertwined with a deep sense of betrayal."},
			{4092651, "line", "vo_91_tyrande_whisperwind_10_f", "Perhaps we can never truly know the ways of the gods, my daughter. But I believe Elune made a choice to aid her sister, not to cause us sorrow."},
			{4092653, "line", "vo_91_tyrande_whisperwind_11_f", "The cycle, the Kaldorei, must now rejoin, no more looking to the past. It is time to embrace our future."},
			{4093031, "line", "vo_91_tyrande_whisperwind_12_f", "I am myself again."},
			{4093033, "line", "vo_91_tyrande_whisperwind_13_f", "I was present for every moment and yet, outside myself, as much a witness as you were."},
			{4093035, "line", "vo_91_tyrande_whisperwind_14_f", "Was mine as much as hers?"},
			{4093037, "line", "vo_91_tyrande_whisperwind_15_f", "That Elune did not tell me, daughter. Not yet."},
			{4317870, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_01", "I came here seeking vengeance."},
			{4317871, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_02", "But within these groves, and by the light of Elune, I found something I feared lost."},
			{4317872, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_03", "Hope."},
			{4317873, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_04", "On behalf of all the Kaudorei, I thank you."},
			{4317874, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_05", "Undo, Falador."},
			{4317875, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_06", "The Winter Queen called her gift a seed. Ysera, my beloved friend, could it truly be so?"},
			{4317876, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_07", "then it must be kept safe until it can take root."},
			{4317878, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_08", "Then tell us the price, and it shall be paid."},
			{4324011, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_09", "What game do you play now, Banshee?"},
			{4324012, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_10", "The Sylvanas I hunted would never submit to the blade of her enemy."},
			{4324013, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_11", "Your newfound remorse might be genuine."},
			{4324014, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_12", "There will be no peace for you, Windrunner."},
			{4324015, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_13", "The prisoner is in my charge now"},
			{4324016, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_14", "Below lies the maw."},
			{4324017, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_15", "Every soul lost in its depths, betrayed or condemned."},
			{4324018, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_16", "You shall find and send forth to the Arbiter."},
			{4324019, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_17", "You will toil there, under Dorotha's watchful eye."},
			{4324020, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_18", "This is how you shall bring renewal to your victims."},
			{4324021, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_19", "Undo, Falador, old friend, watch her well."},
			{4324517, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_20", "The Banshee's penance will save countless lost souls. A faith that would not have come to pass had I slain her in Ardenweald."},
			{4324518, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_21", "Perhaps that is why Mother Moon stayed my hand."},
			{4324519, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_22", "I thank you for your aid. Soon I must return to Azeroth to begin healing the Kaldorei and preserving our future."},
			{4324520, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_23", "The Horde inflicted a grievous wound upon my people. You may never earn my trust, but you have my thanks for setting things right."},
			{4330825, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_24", "But it can never erase all you have done."},
			{4330828, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_25", "Until there is peace for the souls of your victims."},
			{4330831, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_26", "Bring her!"},
			{4331999, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_27", "An unjust fate to which you doomed so many."},
			{4332003, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_28", "And it will be there that your penance begins."},
			{4332006, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_29", "To be judged with the compassion all souls deserve."},
			{4332009, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_30", "scouring every darkened reach."},
			{4332012, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_31", "Until the final soul is free, and you are all that remains."},
			{4332015, "line", "vo_920_tyrande_whisperwind_32", "and my people."},
			{4324010, "line", "vo_92_tyrande_whisperwind_09_f", "You"},
			{4331162, "line", "vo_92_tyrande_whisperwind_28_f", "You"},
			{573184, "line", "vo_et_echooftyrande_event_01", "Moon Goddess, your light dims. I am lost without your guidance."},
			{573186, "line", "vo_et_echooftyrande_event_02", "The darkness closes in. My vision is clouded."},
			{573188, "line", "vo_et_echooftyrande_event_03", "Mother Moon, I can no longer see your light, your daughter is alone in the darkness."},
			{573190, "line", "vo_et_echooftyrande_finale_01", "I can see the light of the moon, so clearly now. It is beautiful."},
			{573202, "line", "vo_et_echooftyrande_slay_01", "A loon guides you through the night."},
			{573204, "line", "vo_et_echooftyrande_spell_01", "Eyes of night, pierce this darkness!"},
			{573206, "line", "vo_et_echooftyrande_spell_02", "Spear of Elune, drive back the night!"},
			{573236, "line", "vo_woe_tyrande_conclusion_01", "Arfurian!"},
			{573238, "line", "vo_woe_tyrande_conclusion_02", "by the very edge."},
			{573240, "line", "vo_woe_tyrande_conclusion_03", "I do not know who you are, but I thank you. Without your aid, our world would be, I do not wish to think about it. Moon Goddess, light your path."},
			{573242, "line", "vo_woe_tyrande_mannoroth_01", "He knows what we attempt, we have not much time, the forest crawls with his demons."},
			{573244, "line", "vo_woe_tyrande_mannoroth_02", "Mother Moon, guide us through this darkness."},
			{573246, "line", "vo_woe_tyrande_mannoroth_03", "Illidan, what is in that vial? What are you doing?"},
			{573248, "line", "vo_woe_tyrande_mannoroth_04", "I cannot strike them! What is this demon magic?"},
			{573250, "line", "vo_woe_tyrande_mannoroth_05", "I will handle the demons. Elune, guide my arrows."},
			{573252, "line", "vo_woe_tyrande_mannoroth_06", "Light of Elune, save me!"},
			{573254, "line", "vo_woe_tyrande_mannoroth_07", "I will hold them back for now."},
			{573256, "line", "vo_woe_tyrande_mannoroth_08", "Illidan, I am out of arrows! Moon Goddess, protect us from the darkness, that we may see your light again another night."},
			{573258, "line", "vo_woe_tyrande_mannoroth_09", "Illidan! You mustn't!"},
			{573260, "line", "vo_woe_tyrande_mannoroth_10", "No! Illidan!"},
			{573262, "line", "vo_woe_tyrande_mannoroth_11", "Malfurion! He has done it! The portal is collapsing!"},
			{573264, "line", "vo_woe_tyrande_mannoroth_12", "There are too many of them!"},
		},
		sound = {
			{569361, "ability", "druid_starfallmissile1"},
			{568377, "ability", "druid_starfallmissile2"},
			{568420, "ability", "druid_starfallmissile3"},
			{569023, "ability", "moonfireimpact"},
			{1597438, "ability", "spell_dr_revamp_moonfire_cast_01"},
			{1597439, "ability", "spell_dr_revamp_moonfire_cast_02"},
			{1597440, "ability", "spell_dr_revamp_moonfire_cast_03"},
			{1597441, "ability", "spell_dr_revamp_moonfire_impact_01"},
			{1597442, "ability", "spell_dr_revamp_moonfire_impact_02"},
			{1597443, "ability", "spell_dr_revamp_moonfire_impact_03"},
			{1484185, "ability", "spell_dr_starfall_missileswithtinkles_loop"},
			{568008, "ability", "starfireimpact"},
		},
	},
	[4] = {
		voice = {
			{551919, "pick", "hightinkermekkatorquegreeting01", "Why hello there, how can I help you?"},
			{551923, "pick", "hightinkermekkatorquegreeting02", "Necessity is the first cousin of invention."},
			{551924, "pick", "hightinkermekkatorquegreeting03", "I just love to tinker."},
			{551920, "pick", "hightinkermekkatorquegreeting04", "Welcome, friend!"},
			{3192654, "pick", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_12_m", "There's always time to tinker."},
			{3192652, "pick", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_10_m", "Remember, safety first!"},
			{3192653, "pick", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_11_m", "Never reject an idea out of hand!"},
			{3192655, "pick", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_13_m", "When in doubt, plan it out!"},
			{3192656, "pick", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_14_m", "Perseverance is the true blueprint to success!"},
			{3192657, "pick", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_15_m", "For Nomeregan!"},
			{3192659, "pick", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_17_m", "Well, fancy seeing you here!"},
			{2443179, "pick", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_29_m", "Time to unveil one of my latest inventions!"},
			{2443173, "pick", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_23_m", "I've calculated your odds of survival. They are not in your favor!"},
			{551922, "aggro", "hightinkermekkatorqueaggro01", "I won't stand for that."},
			{2038482, "shout", "vo_801_high_tinker_mekkatorque_battleshout_01", "AHHHHHHHHHHHHHH"},
			{2038484, "shout", "vo_801_high_tinker_mekkatorque_battleshout_02", "WAAAAAAAH!"},
			{2038485, "shout", "vo_801_high_tinker_mekkatorque_battleshout_04", "AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH"},
			{896324, "alert", "vo_54_or_mekkatorque_intro_1", "Deploy the gear! Establish a perimeter!"},
			{896326, "alert", "vo_54_or_mekkatorque_intro_2", "Oh, hello, friends. We've just about secured the surface. It looks like the real fight's going to be down here."},
			{896328, "alert", "vo_54_or_mekkatorque_intro_3", "Don't worry, we've got your back! FORGE AHEAD, BRAVE HEROES!"},
			{1248470, "line", "vo_70_gelbin_mekkatorque_01", "We've got to take down this portal!"},
			{1248483, "line", "vo_70_gelbin_mekkatorque_02", "It happened in seconds. We were fighting our way up the shore, and then boom! Explosions of fell energy all around us. And these buildings just grew up out of them, filled with demons. I don't know how we're going to be able to push them back at this rate."},
			{1248503, "line", "vo_70_gelbin_mekkatorque_03", "TASTE BLASTER! HAHAHAHA!"},
			{1248505, "line", "vo_70_gelbin_mekkatorque_04", "FANOBIGAN!"},
			{1248507, "line", "vo_70_gelbin_mekkatorque_05", "BACK TO THE NEVER WITH YOU!"},
			{1248584, "line", "vo_70_gelbin_mekkatorque_06", "How are we going to get across?"},
			{1248626, "line", "vo_70_gelbin_mekkatorque_07", "FEL MAGMA INCOMING! WATCH YOURSELVES!"},
			{1248648, "line", "vo_70_gelbin_mekkatorque_08", "That magma's going to erupt! Be ready to dock!"},
			{1995543, "line", "vo_801_high_tinker_mekkatorque_01_m", "Indubitably! I brought some extra machines for backup! Feel free to give them a spin!"},
			{1995544, "line", "vo_801_high_tinker_mekkatorque_02_m", "My machines are at your command!"},
			{1995545, "line", "vo_801_high_tinker_mekkatorque_03_m", "I don't have many of them, but the ones I do are at your disposal!"},
			{1995546, "line", "vo_801_high_tinker_mekkatorque_04_m", "You've got it!"},
			{2437273, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_01_m", "Time to deploy our simian friend! The horde won't know what hit them."},
			{2437274, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_02_m", "UNLEASH THE BEAST!"},
			{2437281, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_03_m", "He was a noble fellow who deserved better. Heroes, do what you have to, but please be merciful."},
			{2437283, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_04_m", "Did someone call for an airstrike?"},
			{2437284, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_05_m", "Stand back, heroes! I'll get you inside the pyramid!"},
			{2437285, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_06_m", "Breach successful! I'll stay out here and keep the skies clear!"},
			{2437444, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_07_m", "Attention horde brutes! This primitive pyramid is now Alliance property!"},
			{2437445, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_08_m", "to demonstrate our capabilities, we've prepared a little, or shall I say, big surprise for you!"},
			{2437446, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_09_m", "You don't have any hope of overcoming no-mish innovation. I advise you to surrender, or to collect a whole lot of bananas."},
			{2437480, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_10_m", "Alliance Forces! Get to the harbor! I've got you covered!"},
			{2437482, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_11_m", "You plan to stop me with that gaudy piece of junk you call a flight suit? Were you planning to sparkle me to death?"},
			{2437484, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_12_m", "Hah! Slap on all the gold and glitter you want! Your inventions are still cut-rate trash!"},
			{2443163, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_13_m", "Have a taste of superior nomesh artillery!"},
			{2443164, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_14_m", "You asked for it!"},
			{2443165, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_15_m", "Let's see how you handle this little gizmo!"},
			{2443166, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_16_m", "Hello me to introduce a favorite gadget of mine!"},
			{2443167, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_17_m", "Get ready for a shocking twist!"},
			{2443168, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_18_m", "I'd advise you to stay grounded!"},
			{2443169, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_19_m", "Thrusters engaged!"},
			{2443170, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_20_m", "Clear the Lending Area!"},
			{2443171, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_21_m", "Let's cut you down to size!"},
			{2443172, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_22_m", "You've got a small problem on your hands!"},
			{2443174, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_24_m", "You face the pinnacle of Nomesh technology!"},
			{2443175, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_25_m", "Suit failing, not looking good."},
			{2443176, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_26_m", "Systems compromised! Get me out of here!"},
			{2443177, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_27_m", "Let's put that horrid intellect Galliwick's brags about to the test!"},
			{2443178, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_28_m", "This should keep you busy for a while!"},
			{2443180, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_30_m", "On behalf of the Alliance, I am prepared to accept your surrender!"},
			{2443181, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_31_m", "The logical thing would be for you to give up now! Hmm... But have I ever known the Horde to be logical?"},
			{2443182, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_32_m", "Your odds of victory are decreasing exponentially by the second!"},
			{2443183, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_33_m", "I know how fond you are of spears and battle axes, but surely you recognize superior technology when you see it?"},
			{2443184, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_34_m", "Target terminated!"},
			{2443185, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_35_m", "One down, more to go!"},
			{2443186, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_36_m", "FOR NOBRAGON!"},
			{2443187, "line", "vo_81_gelbin_mekkatorque_37_m", "This is why you invest in gnomish technology, not that goblin garbage."},
			{3192368, "line", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_01_m", "Where... where am I?"},
			{3192370, "line", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_02_m", "What happened? The attack on Dazar'alor."},
			{3192371, "line", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_03_m", "You have my sincerest gratitude, Prince Erasman, as do you, Kelsey, and you, Champion."},
			{3192373, "line", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_04_m", "Well then, let's recycle some scrap!"},
			{3192374, "line", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_05_m", "We'll make quick work of this lot!"},
			{3192375, "line", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_06_m", "I can hardly believe my eyes, the fabled city of Mechagon, most impressive Prince Erasman."},
			{3192381, "line", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_07_m", "Prince Erasman, it is I who am honored. I will accept your request with one condition."},
			{3192382, "line", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_08_m", "You must promise to stand beside me as my counselor and my friend."},
			{3192384, "line", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_09_m", "Come, let us address our people, together!"},
			{3192658, "line", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_16_m", "I'm counting on you!"},
			{3192660, "line", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_18_m", "Is there something on your mind?"},
			{3192661, "line", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_19_m", "Got something to report?"},
			{3193430, "line", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_20_m", "There's a joke I could tell, but I'm still workshopping it."},
			{3193431, "line", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_21_m", "Watch it! Keep poking me and I'll show you no mercy! That's NOOOOMM MURCY! Get it?"},
			{3193432, "line", "vo_835_gelbin_mekkatorque_22_m", "You make me regret ever leaving my escape pod!"},
			{555226, "line", "vo_qe_mekkatorque_complete01", "Razzle-crush-cog is no more! The people of Ironforge and Nomeregan speak with one voice this day! Hear us well, thermoplog! The day of your defeat approaches!"},
			{555177, "line", "vo_qe_mekkatorque_event01", "Mechjaneer Thermaplug refuses to acknowledge that his defeat is imminent. He has sent Razzlo Crushcog to prevent us from rebuilding our beloved Gnomeregan!"},
			{555201, "line", "vo_qe_mekkatorque_event02", "But our brave friend here has thwarted his plans at every turn. And now the dwarves of Ironforge stand with us!"},
			{555194, "line", "vo_qe_mekkatorque_event03", "Let's send him crawling back to his master, in defeat!"},
			{555188, "line", "vo_qe_mekkatorque_event04", "WE'VE DONE IT! WE ARE VICTORIOUS! HAHA!"},
			{555209, "line", "vo_qe_mekkatorque_event05", "With Crushcog defeated, Thermoplug is sure to be quaking in his mechano tank! And rightly so! You're next, Thermoplug! You're next!"},
			{555222, "line", "vo_qe_mekkatorque_start01", "We assembled a mighty force and defeated Therma Plug's servants, fighting our way into the city. But the usurper Therma Plug had one last trick up his sleeve."},
			{555213, "line", "vo_qe_mekkatorque_start02", "Oh, we were forced to retreat. Therma plug continues to hide behind the radiation, sending his crony crush cog to harass us here on the surface."},
		},
		sound = {
			{569406, "ability", "dynamiteexplode"},
		},
	},
	[5] = {
		voice = {
			{562185, "pick", "thrallgreeting01", "Loctar, friend. What is it you wish?"},
			{562242, "pick", "thrallgreeting02", "Welcome to Orgrimmar. Have you come to serve the Horde?"},
			{1057964, "pick", "vo_60_thrall_farewell_02", "For the Horde!"},
			{1057965, "pick", "vo_60_thrall_farewell_03", "Fight with honor."},
			{1057963, "pick", "vo_60_thrall_farewell_01", "Our spirit will triumph."},
			{1057966, "pick", "vo_60_thrall_farewell_04", "We will not be broken."},
			{1057969, "pick", "vo_60_thrall_greeting_02", "Moktarogar, champion."},
			{562233, "pick", "thrallaggro02", "FOR DOOM HANNER!"},
			{562256, "pick", "cav_thrall_tauntscarloc01", "I'll never be chained again!"},
			{562263, "pick", "cav_thrall_select03", "From this day on, I will rise to any challenge."},
			{562272, "pick", "cav_thrall_healthlow02", "I will fight to the last."},
			{1057968, "greet", "vo_60_thrall_greeting_01", "This is a savage land."},
			{1057970, "greet", "vo_60_thrall_greeting_03", "The Horde has important work here."},
			{1057971, "greet", "vo_60_thrall_greeting_04", "This land is nothing like Azeroth."},
			{1057972, "greet", "vo_60_thrall_greeting_05", "Loctar, Commander!"},
			{562258, "farewell", "cav_thrall_goodbye01", "Goodbye, Teretha. I will never forget your kindness."},
			{1057967, "farewell", "vo_60_thrall_farewell_05", "Run our enemies into the ground."},
			{1057973, "pissed", "vo_60_thrall_pissed_01", "Seriously, are we gonna do this?"},
			{1057974, "pissed", "vo_60_thrall_pissed_02", "Is this what the Horde has come to? I need to speak to Vol'jin about this."},
			{562273, "aggro", "cav_thrall_aggro01", "I have earned my freedom."},
			{562269, "aggro", "cav_thrall_aggro02", "This day is long overdue. Out of my way!"},
			{562276, "aggro", "cav_thrall_aggro03", "I am a slave no longer."},
			{562254, "aggro", "cav_thrall_aggro04", "Blackmore has much to answer for."},
			{562243, "aggro", "thrallaggro01", "Look, Naros!"},
			{562218, "aggro", "thrallaggro03", "Your time has come!"},
			{902161, "alert", "vo_54_or_thrall_intro_1", "It is not too late, Garrosh. Lay down the mantle of Warchief. We can end this here, now, with no more bloodshed."},
			{902163, "alert", "vo_54_or_thrall_intro_2", "Then you have forced my hand. I will correct the mistake I made long ago. Spirits of the wind, the earth, the water, hear my call! Come to my aid!\""},
			{902165, "alert", "vo_54_or_thrall_intro_3", "Never powerless, Garrosh, and never alone."},
			{562145, "alert", "vo_quest_42_thrall_intro_01", "The aspects believe it will, and they should know."},
			{562168, "alert", "vo_quest_42_thrall_intro_01b", "They grew it in the first place."},
			{562163, "alert", "vo_quest_42_thrall_intro_02", "Master Stormrage, it's good to have you back in the waking world."},
			{562139, "alert", "vo_quest_42_thrall_intro_03", "The Twilight's Hammer!"},
			{562207, "alert", "vo_quest_42_thrall_intro_04", "I do not fear death."},
			{562169, "alert", "vo_quest_42_thrall_intro_05", "AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH"},
			{562197, "alert", "wg_thrall_horintro01", "Korkron, stand down!"},
			{562213, "alert", "wg_thrall_horintro02", "Jaina!"},
			{562147, "alert", "wg_thrall_horintro03", "Jaina, what happened at the Wrathgate? It was a betrayal from within."},
			{562160, "alert", "wg_thrall_horintro04", "The Horde has lost the Undercity."},
			{562199, "alert", "wg_thrall_horintro05", "We now prepare to lay siege to the city and bring the perpetrators of this unforgivable crime to justice."},
			{562224, "alert", "wg_thrall_horintro06", "If we are forced into a conflict, the Lich King will destroy our divided forces in Northrend."},
			{562151, "alert", "wg_thrall_horintro07", "We will make this right, Jaina. Tell your king all that you have learned here."},
			{562190, "alert", "wg_thrall_horintro08", "Korkron, prepare transport to the undercity."},
			{4953283, "line", "vo_1007_thrall_01_m", "Our champion has completed the Am'gora. Let us feast in their honor. LOKTA!"},
			{4953508, "line", "vo_1007_thrall_02_m", "Surfing. What was his message?"},
			{4953546, "line", "vo_1007_thrall_03_m", "I am glad you did too, old friend."},
			{4954111, "line", "vo_1007_thrall_04_m", "I... did not complete the Omrigor."},
			{4954117, "line", "vo_1007_thrall_05_m", "I, um, Agra, and Etrich, what brings you here?"},
			{4954156, "line", "vo_1007_thrall_06_m", "If I am to complete the right, I cannot lead the-"},
			{4954269, "line", "vo_1007_thrall_07_m", "The clans have assembled. We answer the call."},
			{4988350, "line", "vo_1007_thrall_08_m", "Thank you all for honoring us with your presence here."},
			{4988351, "line", "vo_1007_thrall_09_m", "When our people came to Azeroth from Draenor, ours was not an easy road."},
			{4988352, "line", "vo_1007_thrall_10_m", "And along the way, many of our ancient traditions were lost."},
			{4988353, "line", "vo_1007_thrall_11_m", "But the time has come to remember the rights of old.\""},
			{4988354, "line", "vo_1007_thrall_12_m", "This champion is the first to complete the new rite of Am'gora."},
			{4988355, "line", "vo_1007_thrall_13_m", "Let their footsteps be followed for generations to come."},
			{4988356, "line", "vo_1007_thrall_14_m", "LOOP TAR!"},
			{5001198, "line", "vo_1007_thrall_15_m", "and to build new traditions that honor our proud legacy."},
			{5044418, "line", "vo_1017_thrall_01_m", "You"},
			{5044415, "line", "vo_102_thrall_01_m", "You"},
			{5320612, "line", "vo_102_thrall_02_m", "Hmm, yes it did. Like on Mount Hijal, all those years ago."},
			{5320614, "line", "vo_102_thrall_03_m", "Jaina, when Amirdrasil took root on Azeroth, for a moment it was as if... like there was..."},
			{5320616, "line", "vo_102_thrall_04_m", "Oh, good. I didn't imagine it."},
			{5320618, "line", "vo_102_thrall_05_m", "Could it be the voice of the World Tree?"},
			{5320620, "line", "vo_102_thrall_06_m", "If we both heard it, felt it, maybe others did too."},
			{5320622, "line", "vo_102_thrall_07_m", "All of us, together."},
			{5701872, "line", "vo_110_thrall_01_m", "or to think you could have stopped what happened, if you had just seen what was right in front of you."},
			{5701876, "line", "vo_110_thrall_02_m", "It's good to have you with us, Alaria."},
			{5723108, "line", "vo_110_thrall_03_m", "There is a vision being seen across Azeroth, a radiant song. We believe it's a warning, but we're unsure of its meaning."},
			{5723109, "line", "vo_110_thrall_04_m", "Meet me in Syllathus. We must ask Azeroth's speaker what this vision means.\""},
			{5723111, "line", "vo_110_thrall_05_m", "The growing stronger."},
			{5723112, "line", "vo_110_thrall_06_m", "Let's hope Magni has some answers."},
			{5723124, "line", "vo_110_thrall_10_m", "Where, Magni? Where must we go?"},
			{5723125, "line", "vo_110_thrall_11_m", "Magni!"},
			{5723129, "line", "vo_110_thrall_12_m", "He'd tried to commune directly with Azeroth. It seems the strain was... too much."},
			{5740163, "line", "vo_110_thrall_13_m", "You found your light again."},
			{5740171, "line", "vo_110_thrall_14_m", "Unworthy."},
			{5740172, "line", "vo_110_thrall_15_m", "Varian Wrynn was a fierce, proud warrior. I respected his strength."},
			{5740173, "line", "vo_110_thrall_16_m", "But you, Anduin, you have your own strength, greater than any sword."},
			{5740215, "line", "vo_110_thrall_17_m", "Azeroth needs its speaker, and so do we."},
			{5758114, "line", "vo_110_thrall_18_m", "What's done is done. We must move forward."},
			{5758115, "line", "vo_110_thrall_19_m", "This is not over."},
			{5758116, "line", "vo_110_thrall_20_m", "Now is not the time to mourn. Now is the time to fight."},
			{5758117, "line", "vo_110_thrall_21_m", "Strength and Unity."},
			{5758118, "line", "vo_110_thrall_22_m", "We must continue our journey."},
			{5758119, "line", "vo_110_thrall_23_m", "Azeroth calls. We must answer."},
			{5781556, "line", "vo_110_thrall_24_m", "Luvsella, the Stormrooks know your intentions. Focus."},
			{5781557, "line", "vo_110_thrall_25_m", "Call them, and they will answer."},
			{5781558, "line", "vo_110_thrall_26_m", "Well done. The Stormrooks have heeded your call."},
			{5782237, "line", "vo_110_thrall_27_m", "Champion to me!"},
			{5782243, "line", "vo_110_thrall_28_m", "Rescue who you can along the way."},
			{5782482, "line", "vo_110_thrall_29_m", "We'll hold the line. Champion, help Magni!"},
			{5782512, "line", "vo_110_thrall_30_m", "We will be back, and we will be ready."},
			{5836792, "line", "vo_110_thrall_31_m", "We have to regroup."},
			{5836794, "line", "vo_110_thrall_32_m", "Has anyone seen Cadgar?"},
			{5836801, "line", "vo_110_thrall_33_m", "Jaina and I will rally the Alliance and the Horn."},
			{5836803, "line", "vo_110_thrall_34_m", "But it will take some time for us to sail back here."},
			{5859108, "line", "vo_110_thrall_35_m", "Champion, this way."},
			{5859109, "line", "vo_110_thrall_36_m", "The air seethes with fury. It drowns the whispers of the elements."},
			{5859886, "line", "vo_110_thrall_37_m", "I will accompany you, champion. I want to learn about the Stormriders and their bond with their rooks."},
			{5859887, "line", "vo_110_thrall_38_m", "We need to ask someone who knows them well. Luvsella, may we speak to you?"},
			{5859889, "line", "vo_110_thrall_39_m", "She is hiding something. Follow her."},
			{5859891, "line", "vo_110_thrall_40_m", "Easy, friend. We don't want to harm your rider."},
			{5859894, "line", "vo_110_thrall_41_m", "You have a bond with the rooks, even those returned to the storm. I can sense it."},
			{5859895, "line", "vo_110_thrall_42_m", "Tell me, how is it that you were given a rook if you're not a Stormrider?"},
			{5859897, "line", "vo_110_thrall_43_m", "It seems you were meant for each other, this boat well."},
			{5859902, "line", "vo_110_thrall_44_m", "You knew Baelgrim, and you know the Stormrooks, then you were a Stormrider."},
			{5859911, "line", "vo_110_thrall_45_m", "Reach out through the storm, Luvsella, as we discussed!"},
			{5859914, "line", "vo_110_thrall_46_m", "Good. Open your mind and your heart to them."},
			{5859918, "line", "vo_110_thrall_47_m", "Go to her, champion. Lend her your strength."},
			{5859936, "line", "vo_110_thrall_48_m", "Just like we practice, Lufcilla. The storm is your ally."},
			{5859939, "line", "vo_110_thrall_49_m", "Well done. The storm has granted the rooks its strength."},
			{5860004, "line", "vo_110_thrall_50_m", "An ancient stormrider outpost. Meet us there, champion."},
			{5860011, "line", "vo_110_thrall_51_m", "LOTAR, EVERYONE!"},
			{5860014, "line", "vo_110_thrall_52_m", "The Rooks have chosen their riders. A true bond has been forged."},
			{5860015, "line", "vo_110_thrall_53_m", "The Stormrooks and their new riders need time, and you are needed at the shore, champion."},
			{5860025, "line", "vo_110_thrall_54_m", "Is this all that remains of the Stormriders?"},
			{5860034, "line", "vo_110_thrall_55_m", "These Stormriders will heal in time, but what about the Stormrooks?"},
			{5860035, "line", "vo_110_thrall_56_m", "Your bond with Shubendre is strong, Luvsella. You may be key to summoning more Stormrooks."},
			{852165, "line", "vo_53_thrall_oldtimes_01", "Not quite, old friend. Times have changed. The line between friend and foe is not so clear."},
			{852167, "line", "vo_53_thrall_razor_start_01", "Wait, Ful'jin. Horde is spilling Horde blood. It's tearing me apart."},
			{852169, "line", "vo_53_thrall_razor_start_02", "I know. I trust you to lead the siege. I am needed elsewhere."},
			{852171, "line", "vo_53_thrall_razor_start_03", "I refuse to believe that all of my brethren support Garrosh."},
			{852173, "line", "vo_53_thrall_razor_start_04", "I am going to Orgrimmar. Alone. Etrig, Sarfang, surely they are standing against Garrosh. I must find others.\""},
			{852175, "line", "vo_53_thrall_razor_start_04a", "It's a risk I have to take, but if I am killed, please watch over Agra and my boy."},
			{852177, "line", "vo_53_thrall_razor_start_05", "It has to be said Vol'jin. If we don't make it through this, I want you to know you have always been my friend, my brother."},
			{852179, "line", "vo_53_thrall_razor_start_06", "For the Horde."},
			{1057908, "line", "vo_60_ffr_bladespire_thrall_01", "I will forestall any counter-attacks by the enemy. Lok Tarogar!"},
			{1057909, "line", "vo_60_ffr_bladespire_thrall_02", "Stand back."},
			{1057910, "line", "vo_60_ffr_bladespire_thrall_03", "Go on ahead, Durotan awaits, I must catch my breath."},
			{1057911, "line", "vo_60_ffr_bladespire_thrall_04", "It is up to you, champion. I will stay here and help with the wounded slaves you rescued."},
			{1061198, "line", "vo_60_ffr_ffr_bladespire_thrall_04", "It seems the elements of Draenor do not respond to me as they do on Azeroth."},
			{1057912, "line", "vo_60_ffr_finale_stage0_thrall_01", "You'd better hurry! Here they come!"},
			{1057913, "line", "vo_60_ffr_finale_stage2_thrall_01", "JABU!"},
			{1057914, "line", "vo_60_ffr_finale_stage2_thrall_02", "I was taught by the best, Dregthar."},
			{1057915, "line", "vo_60_ffr_finale_stage2_thrall_03", "He'd be pleased to hear you say that."},
			{1057916, "line", "vo_60_ffr_finale_stage3_thrall_01", "I do, I saw that my mate remained behind to care for our little ones."},
			{1057917, "line", "vo_60_ffr_finale_stage3_thrall_02", "I never looked at it that way."},
			{1057918, "line", "vo_60_ffr_finale_stage5_thrall_01", "HERE COMES ANOTHER ELLIC!"},
			{1057919, "line", "vo_60_ffr_finale_stage7_thrall_01", "Chieftain, do you hear that rumbling?"},
			{1057920, "line", "vo_60_ffr_finale_stage8_thrall_01", "LOCKTAROGA!"},
			{1057921, "line", "vo_60_ffr_find_ganar_thrall_01", "Don't worry, this hero will convince Gennar to return. Your brother values strength, and my friend possesses that in abundance."},
			{1057922, "line", "vo_60_ffr_flight_thrall_01", "Qunar seemed bent on dealing out retribution to both."},
			{1057923, "line", "vo_60_ffr_flight_thrall_02", "What is that? I see a fortress of stone."},
			{1057924, "line", "vo_60_ffr_fury_thrall_01", "Champion, I heard Drakthar's call. I am with you."},
			{1057925, "line", "vo_60_ffr_fury_thrall_02", "The fury is dying. We don't have much time."},
			{1057926, "line", "vo_60_ffr_fury_thrall_03", "He has become one with the fury, their spirits are now merged."},
			{1057927, "line", "vo_60_ffr_landing_thrall_01", "You mentioned the Frostwolf chieftain."},
			{1057928, "line", "vo_60_ffr_landing_thrall_02", "Dura-tan."},
			{1057929, "line", "vo_60_ffr_plantflag_thrall_01", "This terrain is ideal for a stronghold."},
			{1057930, "line", "vo_60_ffr_plantflag_thrall_02", "The very best."},
			{1057931, "line", "vo_60_ffr_plantflag_thrall_03", "Gazlow here oversaw the construction of Orgrimmar."},
			{1057932, "line", "vo_60_ffr_stone_thrall_01", "I can feel it. This land speaks to me, but in a language I do not yet understand."},
			{1057933, "line", "vo_60_ffr_stone_thrall_02", "The spirits will never abandon you, Drak'thahr. This I can promise."},
			{1057934, "line", "vo_60_ffr_thunderfall_thrall_01", "The Thunderlords retreat! They are making their way through Thunder Pass to the Iron Horde."},
			{1057935, "line", "vo_60_ffr_thunderfall_thrall_02", "What is this?"},
			{1057936, "line", "vo_60_ffr_to_gormaul_thrall_01", "Durotan, your brother has already rushed ahead."},
			{1057937, "line", "vo_60_ffr_vouching_thrall_01", "Thank you, Chieftain. We will establish a foothold immediately."},
			{1057938, "line", "vo_60_ngd_quest_thrall_01", "Together we will bring justice to Garrosh and the Warsong Clan."},
			{1057939, "line", "vo_60_ngd_quest_thrall_02", "The Burning Blade is an honorable clan, but they have chosen the wrong side in this conflict."},
			{1057940, "line", "vo_60_ngd_quest_thrall_03", "We must defeat the ogres, the burning blade, and the orcs at Lokrath. Then we'll be ready to move on Grommashar."},
			{1057941, "line", "vo_60_ngd_warsong_horde_thrall_01", "Get lost!"},
			{1057942, "line", "vo_60_ngd_warsong_horde_thrall_02", "No. No more, Keros. Just you and me."},
			{1057943, "line", "vo_60_ngd_warsong_horde_thrall_03", "I challenge you to Makkora!"},
			{1057944, "line", "vo_60_ngd_warsong_thrall_01", "Scare us!"},
			{1057945, "line", "vo_60_ngd_warsong_thrall_02", "No. No more, Garrosh. Just you and me."},
			{1057946, "line", "vo_60_ngd_warsong_thrall_03", "I challenge you to Makkora!"},
			{1057947, "line", "vo_60_tan_thrall_ally_01", "Stay alive, champion."},
			{1057948, "line", "vo_60_tan_thrall_dpevents_01", "The elements will grant us time for Azeroth!"},
			{1057949, "line", "vo_60_tan_thrall_dpevents_02", "Fury of Earth, grant me your strength!"},
			{1057950, "line", "vo_60_tan_thrall_dpevents_03", "I... I grow weary. The elements are barely a whisper."},
			{1057951, "line", "vo_60_tan_thrall_dpevents_04", "Rest now, heroes. Soon, more will come. We must allow our champion to finish the mission. For Azeroth."},
			{1057952, "line", "vo_60_tan_thrall_dpevents_05", "Archmage, if our champion is to succeed in their mission, the vanguard must not fall.\""},
			{1057953, "line", "vo_60_tan_thrall_dpevents_06", "I will not stand by and watch our heroes be destroyed."},
			{1057954, "line", "vo_60_tan_thrall_dpevents_07", "Fury of Storms, hear my plea!"},
			{1057955, "line", "vo_60_tan_thrall_dpevents_08", "I will not be able to defend the front for much longer. My power here is greatly diminished. The champion must succeed or Azeroth will fall."},
			{1057956, "line", "vo_60_tan_thrall_holdout_01", "GOOD LUCK"},
			{1057957, "line", "vo_60_tanaan_arena_03", "A combat arena. This may be a trap, but at least we'll die with honor."},
			{1057958, "line", "vo_60_tanaan_taste_of_iron_07", "Hold strong, everyone. Here they come."},
			{1061197, "line", "vo_60_tanaan_thrall_cave", "Kandar, get us out of here!"},
			{1057959, "line", "vo_60_tanaan_thrall_speech_01", "Fury of Earth, grant these heroes your protection!"},
			{1057960, "line", "vo_60_tanaan_thrall_speech_02", "FURY OF FIRE! Ignite our fists and weapons!"},
			{1057961, "line", "vo_60_tanaan_thrall_speech_03", "Fury of Wind, honor these soldiers with your presence."},
			{1057962, "line", "vo_60_tanaan_thrall_speech_04", "Fury of water, heal our injured."},
			{1370340, "line", "vo_701_thrall_01", "The Doom Hammer"},
			{1370341, "line", "vo_701_thrall_02", "We must move quickly! Speak with Milra and follow me into the maelstrom!"},
			{1370342, "line", "vo_701_thrall_03", "Aronark is familiar with the darkest depths of Azeroth's oceans. He will know how best to proceed."},
			{1370371, "line", "vo_701_thrall_04", "I've got this one, Shaiman. Help the others!"},
			{1370372, "line", "vo_701_thrall_05", "Shaiman, I have an urgent message."},
			{1370373, "line", "vo_701_thrall_06", "Yes, we must strike back, but how?"},
			{1370374, "line", "vo_701_thrall_07", "Look out!"},
			{1370375, "line", "vo_701_thrall_08", "Your master has not won yet."},
			{1370376, "line", "vo_701_thrall_09", "Spirits, hear my call!"},
			{1370377, "line", "vo_701_thrall_10", "GRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRLE"},
			{1370378, "line", "vo_701_thrall_11", "They will come for us."},
			{1370431, "line", "vo_701_thrall_12", "I remember the night Orgrim fell, run through by a knight's lance during the liberation of the last orc internment camp. As he bled out onto the fields of Arathi, he bestowed the Doomhammer to me."},
			{1373726, "line", "vo_703_thrall_01", "We must fight together, or we will perish alone."},
			{1373727, "line", "vo_703_thrall_02", "We must not lose hope."},
			{1373728, "line", "vo_703_thrall_03", "Never give in."},
			{1373729, "line", "vo_703_thrall_04", "Fight on!"},
			{1373730, "line", "vo_703_thrall_05", "This is our darkest hour."},
			{1373731, "line", "vo_703_thrall_06", "The Legion will stop at nothing."},
			{1373732, "line", "vo_703_thrall_07", "What news?"},
			{1373733, "line", "vo_703_thrall_08", "I always knew this day would come."},
			{1413717, "line", "vo_703_thrall_09", "The Doom Hammer is somewhere in these chambers. I can feel it."},
			{1413719, "line", "vo_703_thrall_10", "Scout the chambers ahead. I will stay nearby."},
			{1413721, "line", "vo_703_thrall_11", "All the more reason to get to the Doomhammer first."},
			{1413725, "line", "vo_703_thrall_12", "Doomhammer. It felt like dead weight in my hands. The elements were silent. It has been this way since I used it to slay Garrosh."},
			{1413727, "line", "vo_703_thrall_13", "We've got to keep moving. Get Zune as close."},
			{1413729, "line", "vo_703_thrall_14", "The Doomhammer! Get the Doomhammer! Prove your power as a shaman!"},
			{1413733, "line", "vo_703_thrall_15", "The whole of Azeroth will rise against you, demon!"},
			{1413735, "line", "vo_703_thrall_16", "the very earth beneath your feet, and the skies above your head will lash out against your damned crusade!"},
			{1413737, "line", "vo_703_thrall_17", "The Doomhammer chose you, Shaiman. Already you wield it with a power that I never tapped into."},
			{1413739, "line", "vo_703_thrall_18", "I must go my own way. I have a great deal of thinking to do. Agra will be at the maelstrom shortly. Listen to her counsel. She has taught me so much."},
			{1413741, "line", "vo_703_thrall_19", "Go back to the earthen ring, bring them together, turn their might against a legion. This is your time."},
			{1413743, "line", "vo_703_thrall_20", "The Doomhammer is not merely a weapon, it is a symbol, a symbol of hope, of power, proof that an individual can change the world."},
			{1413745, "line", "vo_703_thrall_21", "The Doomhammer could be anywhere. We'll have to split up."},
			{1413747, "line", "vo_703_thrall_22", "I will speak with the shaman at the temple of earth."},
			{1413751, "line", "vo_703_thrall_23", "Shriman, you must seek out the stone mother, but be cautious. She is quick to anger."},
			{1413753, "line", "vo_703_thrall_24", "We should meet back up at Therazane's throne once we know more. Good luck to both of you."},
			{1413789, "line", "vo_703_thrall_25", "The shaman at the temple of earth know nothing."},
			{1495437, "line", "vo_703_thrall_26_m", "Rhaegar has a plan. Speak with him. He's good to have at your back in a fight."},
			{1248600, "line", "vo_70_thrall_01", "FODRING!"},
			{1248628, "line", "vo_70_thrall_02", "The magma erupts! Watch yourselves!"},
			{1248650, "line", "vo_70_thrall_03", "He breathes that foul breath again. Look out!"},
			{1248711, "line", "vo_70_thrall_04", "There are... too many of them!"},
			{1248739, "line", "vo_70_thrall_05", "It looks like our reinforcements have arrived."},
			{1248743, "line", "vo_70_thrall_06", "Hmm, there's only one way out of this one, old friend."},
			{1248755, "line", "vo_70_thrall_07", "Back to the nether!"},
			{1248757, "line", "vo_70_thrall_08", "You"},
			{1248759, "line", "vo_70_thrall_09", "LUTAROGAR!"},
			{1248773, "line", "vo_70_thrall_10", "There's something odd about the crystals surrounding that spire. They feel wrong. Like they're in two places at once. Hm."},
			{1248777, "line", "vo_70_thrall_11", "Yes, they must anchor it to this world."},
			{1248789, "line", "vo_70_thrall_12", "FOCUS ON THE COMMANDER!"},
			{1248794, "line", "vo_70_thrall_13", "FELFIRE RAINS FROM THE SKY! LOOK OUT!"},
			{1248806, "line", "vo_70_thrall_14", "It is good to fight with you again, Warchief."},
			{1248810, "line", "vo_70_thrall_15", "There's only one way to the tomb. Are you ready?"},
			{1248816, "line", "vo_70_thrall_16", "They're expanding faster than we've seen before!"},
			{1248820, "line", "vo_70_thrall_17", "What?"},
			{1248826, "line", "vo_70_thrall_18", "THEY'RE ALIVE!"},
			{1248836, "line", "vo_70_thrall_19", "those crystals again. If we can get close to them, we can bring this thing down!"},
			{1248840, "line", "vo_70_thrall_20", "BREAK THE CRYSTALS!"},
			{1248844, "line", "vo_70_thrall_21", "This invasion is unlike any I have ever witnessed, and I don't think we've seen the last of their surprises."},
			{1248856, "line", "vo_70_thrall_22", "We will find him. Horde forces, keep your eyes open for survivors. Rescue as many as you are able."},
			{1248906, "line", "vo_70_thrall_23", "There, across the chasm, Gul'dan! He has Tyrion."},
			{1248912, "line", "vo_70_thrall_24", "Spirits of Earth, aid me!"},
			{3050304, "line", "vo_825_thrall_01_m_rtc", "Varok Saurfinn!"},
			{3050305, "line", "vo_825_thrall_02_m_rtc", "SON OF KORUK"},
			{3050306, "line", "vo_825_thrall_03_m_rtc", "Supreme Commander of the Might of Kalimdor."},
			{3050307, "line", "vo_825_thrall_04_m_rtc", "High Overlord of the Horde!"},
			{3050308, "line", "vo_825_thrall_05_m_rtc", "He led the charge against the Lich King. He defended our world from the Legion."},
			{3050309, "line", "vo_825_thrall_06_m_rtc", "Saurfang inspired all of us to strive for true honor, and his legacy will live on in our deeds."},
			{3053539, "line", "vo_825_thrall_07_m_rtc", "You have earned your warrior's death, old friend."},
			{3053542, "line", "vo_825_thrall_08_m_rtc", "Now greet your son with honor and glory."},
			{3055458, "line", "vo_825_thrall_09_m", "Saurfang and I spoke much of honor in the Horde, of our path forward from this crossroads."},
			{3055459, "line", "vo_825_thrall_10_m", "I never thought we would have to walk it without him. It falls to us to decide what the Horde will become.\""},
			{3055460, "line", "vo_825_thrall_11_m", "Azeroth needs our strength now more than ever. Grieve for Saurfang and make ready to defend the world he died for.\""},
			{2921745, "line", "vo_82_thrall_01_m", "I have not walked these halls since we faced Garrosh."},
			{2921748, "line", "vo_82_thrall_02_m", "Stay your hand! We're only here to-"},
			{2921749, "line", "vo_82_thrall_03_m", "Stay close. We'll sneak past the guards together."},
			{2921750, "line", "vo_82_thrall_04_m", "Wait here."},
			{2921751, "line", "vo_82_thrall_05_m", "MOVE! QUICKLY!"},
			{2921752, "line", "vo_82_thrall_06_m", "GO!"},
			{2921753, "line", "vo_82_thrall_07_m", "Hold here."},
			{2921760, "line", "vo_82_thrall_08_m", "Stay focused, Bane's life is all that matters right now."},
			{2922114, "line", "vo_82_thrall_09_m", "For Azeroth."},
			{2922115, "line", "vo_82_thrall_10_m", "Together, we are strong."},
			{2922116, "line", "vo_82_thrall_11_m", "Let honor guide your path."},
			{2922117, "line", "vo_82_thrall_12_m", "No time."},
			{2922118, "line", "vo_82_thrall_13_m", "DRONKAR"},
			{2922119, "line", "vo_82_thrall_14_m", "Well met."},
			{2923537, "line", "vo_82_thrall_15_m", "We too have come to save Bane."},
			{2923538, "line", "vo_82_thrall_16_m", "Hmmm... Agreed."},
			{2923936, "line", "vo_82_thrall_17_m", "PAIN!"},
			{2991956, "line", "vo_82_thrall_18_m", "WELL DONE CHAMPION!"},
			{2993649, "line", "vo_82_thrall_19_m", "Jaina"},
			{3170853, "line", "vo_835_thrall_01_m", "No, I told Safang I would not lead the Horde again."},
			{3170854, "line", "vo_835_thrall_02_m", "But perhaps the question is not who should become Warchief, but whether there should be one at all."},
			{3170857, "line", "vo_835_thrall_03_m", "It is true, the Horde has changed. Our ranks have grown and new voices have stepped forth to lead."},
			{3170858, "line", "vo_835_thrall_04_m", "This is what makes us strong. All of us, building a new future, together.\""},
			{3189101, "line", "vo_835_thrall_05_m", "Galliwix has fled the city along with the rest of Sylvanas' inner circle. That leaves the Bilgewater cartel without its trade prince."},
			{3189102, "line", "vo_835_thrall_06_m", "It was your cleverness and ingenuity that built the walls of Orgrimmar. I can't think of anyone I would trust more to take over as leader.\""},
			{3189105, "line", "vo_835_thrall_07_m", "Can you be sure that none of the goblins here are still being funded by Galliwicks?"},
			{3194765, "line", "vo_835_thrall_08_m", "The elements have spoken! Azeroth is doomed!"},
			{3194766, "line", "vo_835_thrall_09_m", "The blood of the old god is our only salvation."},
			{3194767, "line", "vo_835_thrall_10_m", "You will drink, or you will die!"},
			{3194768, "line", "vo_835_thrall_11_m", "WE MUST OBEY NAZAF!"},
			{3194769, "line", "vo_835_thrall_12_m", "None can overcome his might!"},
			{3194770, "line", "vo_835_thrall_13_m", "Thank you, huh, for streaming."},
			{3670140, "line", "vo_901_thrall_01_m", "I... will manage."},
			{3670141, "line", "vo_901_thrall_02_m", "Thank you for coming to my aid, Jaina."},
			{3670158, "line", "vo_901_thrall_03_m", "Let's hope so. Our captors won't be pleased you managed to slip past them again."},
			{3670195, "line", "vo_901_thrall_04_m", "Another ambush, bring them down!"},
			{3671080, "line", "vo_901_thrall_05_m", "something has changed. Pure noble souls are being held captive here as well. They cry out in torment.\""},
			{3671085, "line", "vo_901_thrall_06_m", "We have endured countless torments. At times it felt as if we were being...tested. Though for what purpose I cannot say."},
			{3671486, "line", "vo_901_thrall_07_m", "This is the Trimaculum. Here, souls are tormented, twisted into wretched shades."},
			{3698558, "line", "vo_901_thrall_08_m", "These bonds are too strong to break by force. We must find a way to free him.\""},
			{3707768, "line", "vo_901_thrall_09_m", "Sylvanas. What does she want with him?"},
			{3707779, "line", "vo_901_thrall_10_m", "Find the cave on the other side of the chasm, our allies will protect you there."},
			{3707781, "line", "vo_901_thrall_11_m", "Your bonds are broken. Hurry, before the guards return!"},
			{3707784, "line", "vo_901_thrall_12_m", "Thank you, Anduin. It'll feel good to be back at full strength."},
			{3707830, "line", "vo_901_thrall_13_m", "Still no sign of Tyrande. We cannot leave her alone in this nightmare.\""},
			{3707833, "line", "vo_901_thrall_14_m", "Hold. I hear something stirring."},
			{3707837, "line", "vo_901_thrall_15_m", "For Azeroth!"},
			{3707840, "line", "vo_901_thrall_16_m", "This sound... it's unbearable!"},
			{3707842, "line", "vo_901_thrall_17_m", "Look, on the precipice above, is that?"},
			{3707968, "line", "vo_901_thrall_18_m", "I believe I have, in a place very far from here."},
			{3707969, "line", "vo_901_thrall_19_m", "This must be the dagger. Bane's blood still stains its blade."},
			{3707970, "line", "vo_901_thrall_20_m", "A crossbow? I prefer to strike my enemies face to face."},
			{3707971, "line", "vo_901_thrall_21_m", "I suppose it's got heft to it. Let's see what else we can find, though."},
			{3707972, "line", "vo_901_thrall_22_m", "I've never been one for staves, but at least it won't break in a melee."},
			{3707973, "line", "vo_901_thrall_23_m", "Let's keep looking!"},
			{3707974, "line", "vo_901_thrall_24_m", "A serviceable weapon, though I've never understood why the Alliance seems so fixated with swords."},
			{3707975, "line", "vo_901_thrall_25_m", "Hm. Too much blade. Not enough. Halved."},
			{3707976, "line", "vo_901_thrall_26_m", "Hmmm, too long a handle."},
			{3707977, "line", "vo_901_thrall_27_m", "Better than nothing, I suppose. Let's take one more look."},
			{3707978, "line", "vo_901_thrall_28_m", "At last! A proper warrior's weapon!"},
			{3707979, "line", "vo_901_thrall_29_m", "If the jailer comes, he will taste my steel!"},
			{3707980, "line", "vo_901_thrall_30_m", "When I break the blade, be prepared for whatever comes."},
			{3708015, "line", "vo_901_thrall_31_m", "It almost did, were it not for this champion."},
			{3708020, "line", "vo_901_thrall_32_m", "We seek a waystone located beyond the cauldron, have you seen it?"},
			{3715508, "line", "vo_901_thrall_33_m", "We have stopped endless armies before. We will never yield!"},
			{3715555, "line", "vo_901_thrall_34_m", "BAYNE! NOOO!"},
			{3715562, "line", "vo_901_thrall_35_m", "Jaina, can you hide us from their sight?"},
			{3715574, "line", "vo_901_thrall_36_m", "Despite all Sylvanas has done, I never thought she'd be part of something like this."},
			{3723906, "line", "vo_901_thrall_37_m", "You"},
			{3723907, "line", "vo_901_thrall_38_m", "You"},
			{3723908, "line", "vo_901_thrall_39_m", "You"},
			{3723909, "line", "vo_901_thrall_40_m", "You"},
			{3742286, "line", "vo_901_thrall_41_m", "What is it, Highlord? What do you sense?"},
			{3742287, "line", "vo_901_thrall_42_m", "Fight, Highlord! We're with you!"},
			{3742288, "line", "vo_901_thrall_43_m", "Well done, Jaina. We nearly lost him."},
			{3742289, "line", "vo_901_thrall_44_m", "You've seen the Jailer's armies. We're not ready to launch a full-scale assault. If we follow our hearts and rush in, we could lose everything."},
			{3742290, "line", "vo_901_thrall_45_m", "then we must remain patient. Maw Walker, continue your efforts to undermine the Jailer's cause."},
			{3742291, "line", "vo_901_thrall_46_m", "When the time comes, we will find Anduin and bring him home.\""},
			{3742292, "line", "vo_901_thrall_47_m", "Huh, my friends!"},
			{3742293, "line", "vo_901_thrall_48_m", "The things I saw in that place. The torments I endured."},
			{3742294, "line", "vo_901_thrall_49_m", "My captors spoke of a valuable prisoner, held deep within the jailer's tower."},
			{3742295, "line", "vo_901_thrall_50_m", "It has to be Anduin."},
			{3742333, "line", "vo_901_thrall_51_m", "I have seen only the darkest reaches of the Shadowlands. It is good to know there are places of hope as well."},
			{3742336, "line", "vo_901_thrall_52_m", "May the spirits of my ancestors be safe, in realms of comfort and peace�"},
			{3742911, "line", "vo_901_thrall_53_m", "Champion, is that really you?"},
			{3742912, "line", "vo_901_thrall_54_m", "Stay back! They'll bind you as well!"},
			{3742913, "line", "vo_901_thrall_55_m", "Hurry! Break these chains before-"},
			{3742914, "line", "vo_901_thrall_56_m", "NOOOOO!"},
			{3742915, "line", "vo_901_thrall_57_m", "Elements, hear me, give me the strength to-"},
			{3742916, "line", "vo_901_thrall_58_m", "YEAH!"},
			{3742917, "line", "vo_901_thrall_59_m", "At last, the torment is over."},
			{3742918, "line", "vo_901_thrall_60_m", "I've had enough of this place. Let's go."},
			{3742919, "line", "vo_901_thrall_61_m", "The more I remember, feels so long ago."},
			{3742920, "line", "vo_901_thrall_62_m", "You escaped the jailer. Yes, it's becoming clearer now."},
			{3742921, "line", "vo_901_thrall_63_m", "The Waystone. Our path out of here."},
			{4069815, "line", "vo_91_thrall_01_m", "Yes, I spoke of Garrosh, son of Grommash Hellscream. I'd hoped to spare him from the darkness as father knew. But instead, I fear I'm to blame for the ruin he unleashed.\""},
			{4069817, "line", "vo_91_thrall_02_m", "I took him from Nagrand, I made him Warchief, but when he needed me most, I left him to falter. And in the end, it was my hand that struck him down.\""},
			{4069819, "line", "vo_91_thrall_03_m", "But I set him upon it."},
			{4069821, "line", "vo_91_thrall_04_m", "Onward. Yes, there is much to be done. Thank you, mother.\""},
			{4071574, "line", "vo_91_thrall_05_m", "Draka, champion, I'd like to join you on your mission."},
			{4071575, "line", "vo_91_thrall_06_m", "He left it to me as a gift, one of many he gave me."},
			{4071576, "line", "vo_91_thrall_07_m", "You were of the Frostwolf clan in life, were you not?"},
			{4071577, "line", "vo_91_thrall_08_m", "You are a warrior of great skill, Draka."},
			{4071578, "line", "vo_91_thrall_09_m", "A human. He wanted a gladiator. He made an enemy."},
			{4071579, "line", "vo_91_thrall_10_m", "My axe! That weapon belongs to me, Mars One!"},
			{4071580, "line", "vo_91_thrall_11_m", "Dragora, it is good to hold it once again."},
			{4071581, "line", "vo_91_thrall_12_m", "Draka, there is something you should know. I am..."},
			{4071582, "line", "vo_91_thrall_13_m", "For Azeroth!"},
			{4071583, "line", "vo_91_thrall_14_m", "You. Knew."},
			{4071584, "line", "vo_91_thrall_15_m", "I was once warchief of the Horde, the shaman of the earthen ring."},
			{4071585, "line", "vo_91_thrall_16_m", "I am uncertain. Much has happened in my life. I do not know where it will lead next."},
			{4071586, "line", "vo_91_thrall_17_m", "Thank you, mother. I will make you proud."},
			{4071587, "line", "vo_91_thrall_18_m", "Margrave. A title that comes with authority and expectations. Much like Warchief."},
			{4071588, "line", "vo_91_thrall_19_m", "I know first hand the trials that come with such power. It can be a heavy burden to carry."},
			{4080489, "line", "vo_91_thrall_20_m", "Bane and I will aid them. We won't let the Jailer claim the Arbiter's sigil."},
			{4081409, "line", "vo_91_thrall_21_m", "Jaina, what was it that Anduin left behind?"},
			{4081410, "line", "vo_91_thrall_22_m", "as a sign that he hasn't been fully dominated by the Jailer's power."},
			{4081464, "line", "vo_91_thrall_23_m", "We tried to stop her, to stop them both. We failed."},
			{4081633, "line", "vo_91_thrall_24_m", "We thought the Jailer was coming to slay the Arbiter, but he... absorbed her essence."},
			{4081636, "line", "vo_91_thrall_25_m", "Maybe she knows."},
			{4082296, "line", "vo_91_thrall_26_m", "Their forces are numberless!"},
			{4082297, "line", "vo_91_thrall_27_m", "Is there no end to these creatures?"},
			{4082356, "line", "vo_91_thrall_28_m", "Yield Sylvanas!"},
			{4082357, "line", "vo_91_thrall_29_m", "For sourfang! For the horde!"},
			{4082361, "line", "vo_91_thrall_30_m", "Spirits, grant me aid!"},
			{4082363, "line", "vo_91_thrall_31_m", "I am in your debt, Highlord."},
			{4082497, "line", "vo_91_thrall_32_m", "My defenses falter!"},
			{4082504, "line", "vo_91_thrall_33_m", "With me, champions, Jaina needs our strength."},
			{4082509, "line", "vo_91_thrall_34_m", "I've opened the way. Go! Stop Sylvanas!"},
			{4082511, "line", "vo_91_thrall_35_m", "Heroes to me! Let's regroup with Jaina!"},
			{4082519, "line", "vo_91_thrall_36_m", "The spirits stand with us!"},
			{4082526, "line", "vo_91_thrall_37_m", "BLOOD AND THUNDER!"},
			{4082593, "line", "vo_91_thrall_38_m", "The Arbiter's defenses are weakening. Stop the Jailer while we still can!"},
			{4093147, "line", "vo_91_thrall_39_m", "The jailer's sanctum looms above us. How do we breach it?"},
			{4093152, "line", "vo_91_thrall_40_m", "The Jailer will unleash all his fury upon us. We must not falter."},
			{4093155, "line", "vo_91_thrall_41_m", "Fight to save our world!"},
			{4324128, "line", "vo_920_thrall_01", "What is to stop this new helm from being used to enslave others?"},
			{4325702, "line", "vo_920_thrall_02", "The jailer will try to dominate our minds. Are you certain we'll be able to resist his power?"},
			{4325714, "line", "vo_920_thrall_03", "We must hold them here. Champions, take the fight to the jailer!"},
			{573726, "line", "vo_ds_thrall_dwbattle_01", "Aspects, aid the heroes as best you can!"},
			{573728, "line", "vo_ds_thrall_dwbattle_02", "These champions are our only hope for exposing Deathwing's weakness. Together we can prevail!"},
			{573730, "line", "vo_ds_thrall_dwbattle_03", "Don't give up! We're counting on you to push Deathwing back!"},
			{573732, "line", "vo_ds_thrall_iris_01", "Heroes, this burden falls to you once again."},
			{573734, "line", "vo_ds_thrall_iris_02", "You must protect us from Deathwing's forces while we imbue the Dragon's soul with the power of the Aspects."},
			{573736, "line", "vo_ds_thrall_iris_03", "Speak to me when you are ready to begin."},
			{573740, "line", "vo_ds_thrall_maelstrom_01", "It is done. At last the destroyer has met his end. Now we can begin to heal our world."},
			{573742, "line", "vo_ds_thrall_maelstrom_02", "Strike now, heroes! Only you can give us our opening!"},
			{573738, "line", "vo_ds_thrall_maelstromslay_01", "Avenge the Fallen! CONTINUE THE FIGHT!"},
			{573744, "line", "vo_ds_thrall_prehagara_01", "It's no use. The power of the Dragon's soul is too great. I cannot wield it safely. The raging forces within it may be the doom of us all."},
			{573746, "line", "vo_ds_thrall_prehagara_02", "Yes, I see. We can finally turn Deathwing's own power back against him."},
			{573748, "line", "vo_ds_thrall_prehagara_04", "We have no choice. We must have faith in our allies."},
			{573752, "line", "vo_ds_thrall_ultraxion_01", "Strength of the earth hear my call shield them in this dark hour the last defenders of Azeroth"},
			{573750, "line", "vo_ds_thrall_ultraxionvictory_01", "I will not fail you. I will not fail this world!"},
			{573754, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_arcurion_01", "Heroes, we have the Dragon Soul. The Aspects await us within warmrest. Hurray, come with me."},
			{573756, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_arcurion_02", "How did they find us? Ready your weapons! We've got to get out of this canyon!"},
			{573758, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_arcurion_03", "What magic is this?"},
			{573760, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_arcurion_04", "Look out!"},
			{573762, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_arcurion_05", "Hurry! We must keep moving!"},
			{573764, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_arcurion_06", "Another ambush! Watch your backs!"},
			{573766, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_arcurion_07", "Take a moment to catch a breath before we move on."},
			{573768, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_arcurion_08", "Show yourself!"},
			{573770, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_arcurion_09", "We're surrounded. Dispatch the Ascendant while I keep the ambushes at bay."},
			{573772, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_arcurion_10", "KEEP FIGHTING!"},
			{573774, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_arcurion_11", "More reinforcements! Watch your back!"},
			{573776, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_arcurion_12", "You've almost got him, Agnokar Loktar. Now we've finished this."},
			{573778, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_arcurion_13", "We've been discovered! I know you're tired, but we cannot keep the aspects waiting."},
			{573780, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_asira_01", "Beware, enemies approach!"},
			{573782, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_asira_02", "Let none stand in our way!"},
			{573784, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_asira_03", "The Twilight's Hammer returns!"},
			{573786, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_asira_04", "LET THEM COME!"},
			{573788, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_asira_05", "Alexstrasz's drakes should meet us here."},
			{573790, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_asira_06", "Up there, above us!"},
			{573792, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_asira_07", "An assassin! Quickly, ready yourselves for battle!"},
			{573794, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_asira_08", "I haven't come this far to be stopped by the likes of you."},
			{573796, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_asira_09", "Well done. Let's see to our friend"},
			{573798, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_asira_10", "The rest of the Drakes should be here shortly. I'll fly on ahead. Catch up when you can."},
			{573800, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_benedictus_01", "I will not, archbishop. It will never be yours."},
			{573802, "line", "vo_hot_thrall_benedictus_02", "You were a figurehead of the light benedictus. How could you betray your own people?"},
			{562170, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_eievent01", "Vol'jin, it's good to see you, brother."},
			{562177, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_eievent02", "Indeed, someone did try to kill me, but that is not my greatest concern at this moment. The world itself calls for my aid."},
			{562245, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_eievent03", "Vol'jin I chose Garrosh because he has the strength to lead our people in these trying times."},
			{562209, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_eievent04", "For all my supposed wisdom, there have been moments that I've barely been able to hold the horde together. The Wrathgate and Undercity displayed that clearly enough."},
			{562146, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_eievent05", "The Horde cries for a hero of old. An orc of true blood that will bow to no human and bear no betrayal. A warrior that will make our people proud again. Garrosh can be that hero."},
			{562210, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_eievent06", "I did not make this decision lightly, Vol'jin. I know our alliances will suffer for it. I know the Horde will be irreversibly changed, but I made this choice with confidence that Garrosh is exactly what the Horde needs."},
			{562219, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_eievent07", "I'm trusting you and the other leaders not to let this divide our people. You are stronger than that."},
			{562236, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_eievent08", "Thrum car, old friend."},
			{562164, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_lievent01", "I will see you up top. Thank you again for my freedom."},
			{562196, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_lievent02", "Spirits of the sea, rise and lay waste to my enemies!"},
			{562250, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_lievent03", "Power of the Ocean! Heed my call!"},
			{562201, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_lievent04", "Children of the watery depths, lay waste to those who foul your realm."},
			{562194, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_lievent05", "SPEED OF THE STORM! HEED MY CALL!"},
			{562156, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_lievent06", "WINS OF BOUNDLESS FURY UNLEASH YOUR TEMPEST UPON THE ALLIANCE!"},
			{562195, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_lievent07", "Sons of Stormwall, descend and destroy those who would prevent me from protecting this world."},
			{562137, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_lievent08", "For now, you will remain the trade prince of the Bilgewater Cartel."},
			{562158, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_lievent09", "I will send a representative from amongst your people to the new Warchief Garrosh Hillscream in Orgrimmar."},
			{562214, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_lievent10", "You will have a new home in Azshara, and the Bilgewater Cartel will become a part of the Horde."},
			{562237, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_maelstrom01", "Citizen of Azeroth, behold."},
			{562212, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_maelstrom02", "Our world groans in agony, besieged by an adversary of unspeakable power."},
			{562140, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_maelstrom03", "As her lands break and crumble, the fractures that divide her people must be mended, for neither side can overcome this threat alone."},
			{562232, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_maelstrom04", "Join me. Cast aside your prejudices."},
			{562217, "line", "vo_qe_dt_thrall_maelstrom05", "Together we must heal Azeroth's wounds and those of her people.\""},
			{562205, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_air_01", "Fail. I have failed this world. The elements will not speak to me. The earthen dream has lost faith in my leadership. My weakness is delivered Azeroth into oblivion."},
			{562165, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_air_02", "Oblivion. Nothing. But Oblivion."},
			{562188, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_air_03", "I have failed the Horde, as Warchief. Garrosh will lead it to ruin. My people, to ruin. Care, my brother? Why did I not listen?"},
			{562246, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_air_04", "Why did I not listen?"},
			{562204, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_air_05", "I know your faith, Agra. Oh my heart, can't you see? I am nothing. Selfish at all I've done, accomplished, all for the sake of pride alone. I am unworthy of you."},
			{562193, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_air_06", "Agra, it is you."},
			{562202, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_air_07", "Agra, I... I can't hold on, I can't... AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA"},
			{562235, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_earth_01", "We are patient."},
			{562238, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_earth_02", "We are patient."},
			{562187, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_earth_03", "We are patient."},
			{562239, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_earth_04", "Now, awaken!"},
			{562162, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_earth_05", "Agra I heard your voice calling me back. Where are we?"},
			{562206, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_earth_06", "Agra! Agra! I can't hear! I can't hear!"},
			{562223, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_finale_01", "In the face of this cataclysm, I've seen how truly fleeting our lives can be. And I, for one, will not waste another second of mine."},
			{562152, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_finale_02", "Though I was not born on Draenor, I have always tried to honor the traditions of our ancestors."},
			{562154, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_finale_03", "I stand before you, Goel, son of Durotan, son of Garad. And if you would have me, I would be your life mate."},
			{562251, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_finale_04", "For so long as I live, I will stand at your side, as you have stood at mine.\""},
			{562248, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_fire_01", "My parents. Murdered before I could know them. Betrayed. Gul'dan. If I must burn my way across the afterlife, I will find you in whatever hell you've hidden. I will have my revenge. Do you hear me?"},
			{562182, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_fire_02", "Raised as a slave, to kill for human amusement, death was too good for Blackmore. Anyone who would enslave another deserves worse than death. All are guilty. All must pay!"},
			{562220, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_fire_03", "King Varian. You wish to make war on my people? You shall have your war, human. You will see the fury of the Horde rage through your cities. You will see your throne split in two. This I swear."},
			{562166, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_fire_04", "Garrosh, Garrosh, Kaeron was my brother!"},
			{562183, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_fire_05", "I am alive."},
			{562222, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_fire_06", "Akra, my heart, you never gave up on me. I owe you my life, everything that I am. For I see now what I had become, so weighted down by doubt and anger. All my life I had chosen to be a slave to fear. A thrall."},
			{562253, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_fire_07", "Fandral sought to use that weakness against me, but what he and his twilight masters never understood is that the elements do not exist to rage and war. They exist to bring harmony within the world and within us. I have seen the truth, and my chains have been broken."},
			{562172, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_fire_08", "Now, I am all that I once was, and more."},
			{562141, "line", "vo_quest_42_thrall_fire_09", "Thank you, my friend. I can never repay your service, or your friendship. Meet us back at the World Tree. There's something I want you to witness."},
			{575487, "line", "vo_thrall_outro_01", "Be gone."},
		},
